+        <li>image->[PAWN_nameFull] pointing toward a column of smoke [circumstance_group]</li>
+        <li>image->[PAWN_nameFull] watching an aircraft pass overhead [circumstance_group]</li>
+        <li>image->[PAWN_nameFull] shielding [PAWN_objective]self from a blast [circumstance_group]</li>
+        <li>circumstance_phrase->with a [AdjectiveBadass] expression</li>
+        <li>circumstance_phrase->with a [AdjectiveBadass] expression</li>
+        <li>circumstance_phrase->with cold efficiency</li>
+        <li>circumstance_phrase->while shouting over the noise</li>
+        <li>circumstance_phrase->while covered in dust</li>
+        <li>desc_sentence->A wall of fire rises behind [PAWN_nameDef].</li>
+        <li>desc_sentence->[Quantity_adjphrase] [Enemy]s can be seen in the distance.</li>
+        <li>desc_sentence->Smoke obscures a [TerrainFeature] in the background.</li>
+        <li>desc_sentence->[Gore] covers the ground.</li>
+        <li>desc_sentence->[Quantity_adjphrase] [Animal]s flee the scene of conflict in fear.</li>
+        <li>desc_sentence->In the distance, a [PersonJob] observes.</li>
+      </rulesStrings>
+    </rulePack>
+  </TaleDef>
+
+  <!-- ── 4. 孕育出人造生物體 ──────────────────────────────────────
+       觸發:DMS.MechBirthExtension.taleOnSuccess。
+       PAWN=代孕者、PRODUCT=落成的建築 (DMS_SynthFormingPod)。
