--- DMS1/Defs/Quests/CourtMartial.xml

+++ DMS2/Defs/Quests/CourtMartial.xml

@@ -0,0 +1,106 @@

+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
+<Defs>
+
+  <!-- ======================= 軍事法庭 ======================= -->
+  <QuestScriptDef>
+    <defName>DMS_CourtMartial</defName>
+    <successHistoryEvent>DMS_QuestSuccess_Ceremony</successHistoryEvent>
+    <failedOrExpiredHistoryEvent>DMS_QuestFailed_Ceremony</failedOrExpiredHistoryEvent>
+    <rootSelectionWeight>1</rootSelectionWeight>
+    <rootMinPoints>0</rootMinPoints>
+    <defaultChallengeRating>2</defaultChallengeRating>
+    <expireDaysRange>6~10</expireDaysRange>
+    <questNameRules>
+      <rulesStrings>
+        <li>questName->Court-martial: [defendant_nameFull]</li>
+        <li>questName->Military tribunal summons</li>
+        <li>questName->Fleet judicial notice</li>
+      </rulesStrings>
+    </questNameRules>
+    <questDescriptionRules>
+      <rulesStrings>
+        <!-- 依被告有無可褫奪的軍銜分流，兩邊各三個隨機變體，佔位符相同、行文相異。
+             defendantRanked 常數由 QuestNode_Root_CourtMartial.RunInt 以
+             QuestGen.AddQuestDescriptionConstants 注入，判定與宣判時的降階條件一致。 -->
+        <!-- 有銜被告：最高軍階持有者，刑度含降職一級。 -->
+        <li>questDescription(defendantRanked==True)->A sergeant of the military police command of [issuerFactionName], [asker_nameFull], has issued a notice over the public band, expressing [asker_possessive] strictly-official concern over the recent military-diplomatic incident caused by [playerFactionName]. As [playerFactionName] counts enlisted personnel of [issuerFactionName] among its members, [asker_pronoun] intends to settle the matter through formal court-martial proceedings.\n\nBy [asker_possessive] account, the highest-ranking officer of [playerFactionName], [defendant_nameFull], must report to the fleet's local military tribunal for investigation and questioning. Should [playerFactionName] cooperate, [asker_pronoun] will immediately requisition an orbital transport to collect [defendant_nameDef], and hostilities between [issuerFactionName] and [playerFactionName] will be suspended for the duration.\n\n[asker_nameDef] tells us the investigation will conclude within [investigationDays] days, after which the accused will answer for the charges in court, the verdict to be pronounced by the [issuerFactionName] Navigation Hall and executed at once. If [defendant_nameDef] cooperates, [defendant_possessive] punishment will be weighed leniently, though given the gravity of a military incident, it will still mean short-term detention and a demotion at the very least.\n\nRoom, board and medical care during [defendant_possessive] sentence will be borne by [issuerFactionName], and [defendant_pronoun] will be returned to [playerFactionName] once it is served.</li>
+
+        <li>questDescription(defendantRanked==True)->Over the public band, [asker_nameFull], a duty sergeant of the [issuerFactionName] military police command, has served us formal notice: the recent military-diplomatic incident attributed to [playerFactionName] will not be ignored. Because members of [playerFactionName] remain on the [issuerFactionName] service roll, [asker_pronoun] insists the affair be resolved before a proper court-martial rather than on a battlefield.\n\nThe terms are plain. Our highest-ranking officer, [defendant_nameFull], is to submit to investigation and questioning at the fleet's local tribunal. Upon our agreement, [asker_pronoun] will requisition an orbital transport for [defendant_nameDef] without delay, and [issuerFactionName] will hold its guns for as long as the proceedings run.\n\nPer [asker_nameDef], the inquiry closes within [investigationDays] days; the accused will then speak in [defendant_possessive] own defense before the bench, and the Navigation Hall of [issuerFactionName] will pass sentence for immediate execution. Cooperation buys leniency, but a military incident of this weight carries no less than brief detention and one grade of demotion.\n\nThe fleet will feed, house and treat [defendant_nameDef] throughout the sentence, and return [defendant_pronoun] to [playerFactionName] when it ends.</li>
+
+        <li>questDescription(defendantRanked==True)->[asker_nameFull], sergeant of the military police command, [issuerFactionName], has broadcast an official communiqué regarding the military-diplomatic incident recently caused by [playerFactionName]. [asker_pronoun] frames it as nothing personal, merely procedure: since [playerFactionName] harbors personnel still enrolled with [issuerFactionName], the matter falls under military jurisdiction and must go before a court-martial.\n\n[asker_pronoun] requires that [defendant_nameFull], the senior rank-holder of [playerFactionName], attend the fleet's local tribunal for investigation and questioning. The moment we consent, an orbital transport will be requisitioned to carry [defendant_nameDef] up, and [issuerFactionName] will suspend all hostilities against [playerFactionName] pending judgment.\n\nAs [asker_nameDef] lays it out: [investigationDays] days of investigation, then the accused argues [defendant_possessive] defense in open court, and the [issuerFactionName] Navigation Hall pronounces sentence on the spot. Willing cooperation will be weighed in mitigation, but the minimum remains short-term detention plus demotion by one grade.\n\nQuarters, rations and medical care during the sentence come at [issuerFactionName]'s expense; [defendant_pronoun] will be shipped back to [playerFactionName] on release.</li>
+
+        <!-- 無銜被告（FindDefendant 走了市場價值 fallback，或未啟用 Royalty）。
+             不提「最高軍階」與「降職」，改成艦隊向殖民地本身索討最看重的人。 -->
+        <li>questDescription(defendantRanked==False)->A sergeant of the military police command of [issuerFactionName], [asker_nameFull], has issued a notice over the public band, expressing [asker_possessive] strictly-official concern over the recent military-diplomatic incident caused by [playerFactionName]. No member of [playerFactionName] holds a commission [asker_pronoun] could act against, so [asker_pronoun] intends to proceed against the settlement itself, through formal court-martial proceedings.\n\nBy [asker_possessive] account, [playerFactionName] must surrender the member it can least afford to lose, [defendant_nameFull], to the fleet's local military tribunal for investigation and questioning. Should [playerFactionName] cooperate, [asker_pronoun] will immediately requisition an orbital transport to collect [defendant_nameDef], and hostilities between [issuerFactionName] and [playerFactionName] will be suspended for the duration.\n\n[asker_nameDef] tells us the investigation will conclude within [investigationDays] days, after which the accused will answer for the charges in court, the verdict to be pronounced by the [issuerFactionName] Navigation Hall and executed at once. There is no rank here to reduce, so nothing can be taken off in mitigation: the sentence is detention, and the whole of it.\n\nRoom, board and medical care during [defendant_possessive] sentence will be borne by [issuerFactionName], and [defendant_pronoun] will be returned to [playerFactionName] once it is served.</li>
+        <li>questDescription(defendantRanked==False)->Over the public band, [asker_nameFull], a duty sergeant of the [issuerFactionName] military police command, has served us formal notice: the recent military-diplomatic incident attributed to [playerFactionName] will not be ignored. Nobody among us carries a commission [asker_pronoun] could try, so [asker_pronoun] is trying the settlement instead, before a proper court-martial rather than on a battlefield.\n\nThe terms are plain. [playerFactionName] is to hand over whoever it values most, and by the fleet's reckoning that is [defendant_nameFull]. Upon our agreement, [asker_pronoun] will requisition an orbital transport for [defendant_nameDef] without delay, and [issuerFactionName] will hold its guns for as long as the proceedings run.\n\nPer [asker_nameDef], the inquiry closes within [investigationDays] days; the accused will then speak in [defendant_possessive] own defense before the bench, and the Navigation Hall of [issuerFactionName] will pass sentence for immediate execution. With no grade to strip, leniency has nothing to work with: the sentence is detention, and the full term of it.\n\nThe fleet will feed, house and treat [defendant_nameDef] throughout the sentence, and return [defendant_pronoun] to [playerFactionName] when it ends.</li>
+        <li>questDescription(defendantRanked==False)->[asker_nameFull], sergeant of the military police command, [issuerFactionName], has broadcast an official communiqué regarding the military-diplomatic incident recently caused by [playerFactionName]. [asker_pronoun] frames it as nothing personal, merely procedure: with no commissioned personnel among us to answer for it, jurisdiction falls on [playerFactionName] as a body, and the matter must still go before a court-martial.\n\n[asker_pronoun] requires that [playerFactionName] give up its most valuable member, named in the communiqué as [defendant_nameFull], to attend the fleet's local tribunal for investigation and questioning. The moment we consent, an orbital transport will be requisitioned to carry [defendant_nameDef] up, and [issuerFactionName] will suspend all hostilities against [playerFactionName] pending judgment.\n\nAs [asker_nameDef] lays it out: [investigationDays] days of investigation, then the accused argues [defendant_possessive] defense in open court, and the [issuerFactionName] Navigation Hall pronounces sentence on the spot. A demotion is the usual mitigation and there is none available here, so what remains is detention, served out to the day.\n\nQuarters, rations and medical care during the sentence come at [issuerFactionName]'s expense; [defendant_pronoun] will be shipped back to [playerFactionName] on release.</li>
+      </rulesStrings>
+    </questDescriptionRules>
+    <root Class="DMS.QuestNode_Root_CourtMartial">
+      <fleetFactionDef>DMS_Army</fleetFactionDef>
+      <transportShipDef>DMS_Ship_TransportShuttle</transportShipDef>
+      <investigationDaysRange>1~3</investigationDaysRange>
+      <!-- 官階 seniority → 服刑天數(反比:官階越高刑期越短,最少 minDetentionDays) -->
+      <seniorityToDetentionDaysCurve>
+        <points>
+          <li>(0, 60)</li>
+          <li>(100, 45)</li>
+          <li>(300, 30)</li>
+          <li>(500, 15)</li>
+          <li>(1000, 5)</li>
+        </points>
+      </seniorityToDetentionDaysCurve>
+      <minDetentionDays>5</minDetentionDays>
+      <!-- 封存科技隱匿級的永久敵對審判：刑期固定一年，且無罪判定與盟友判定一律關閉。
+           這是永久敵對唯一的解除途徑，不能靠官階高就輕輕放過。
+           見 DMS.OccultechSanctionUtility / GameComponent_OccultechSanction。 -->
+      <occultedDetentionDays>60</occultedDetentionDays>
+      <boardingDeadlineDays>2</boardingDeadlineDays>
+      <baseAllyChance>0.15</baseAllyChance>
