+    <defName>DMS_Automatroid</defName>
+    <label>Automatroid Basis</label>
+    <description>These machines are called automatroids because they are not merely a weapon - they are an automatic weapon capable of judging and destroying a target on their own.\n\nA weapon this morally appalling should never have been accepted under normal circumstances, but it was used so widely by every power during the Third World War that it became an ordinary and unavoidable part of the battlefield long ago.</description>
