--- DMS1/Ideology/Languages/ChineseTraditional (繁體中文)/DefInjected/PreceptDef/DMS_Ideology.xml

+++ DMS2/Ideology/Languages/ChineseTraditional (繁體中文)/DefInjected/PreceptDef/DMS_Ideology.xml

@@ -0,0 +1,64 @@

+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
+<LanguageData>
+  
+  <!-- EN: strict -->
+  <DMS_Formality_Strict.label>嚴格</DMS_Formality_Strict.label>
+  <!-- EN: Discipline, ceremony and military law are all part of keeping order. To break their forms is shameful. -->
+  <DMS_Formality_Strict.description>紀律、儀典與軍法都是維持秩序的一部分。而破壞它們的形式是可恥的行為。</DMS_Formality_Strict.description>
+  
+  <!-- EN: casual -->
+  <DMS_Formality_Casual.label>隨意</DMS_Formality_Casual.label>
+  <!-- EN: Rank is just a title. Ceremony is just procedure. -->
+  <DMS_Formality_Casual.description>軍階只是一個頭銜。儀式只是流程。</DMS_Formality_Casual.description>
+  
+  <!-- EN: contemptuous -->
+  <DMS_Formality_Contemptuous.label>鄙夷</DMS_Formality_Contemptuous.label>
+  <!-- EN: Military law is the oppressor's instrument of violence. To serve as the oppressor's executioner is shameful. -->
+  <DMS_Formality_Contemptuous.description>軍法是壓迫者的暴力工具。而當壓迫者的劊子手是可恥的。</DMS_Formality_Contemptuous.description>
+  
+  <!-- EN: venerated -->
+  <DMS_Operations_Venerated.label>崇尚</DMS_Operations_Venerated.label>
+  <!-- EN: The unit exists to be used. A completed operation is the highest thing we do, and a failed one is a wound the whole colony carries. Fire support is not something to apologize for. -->
+  <DMS_Operations_Venerated.description>完成一次軍事行動是一個人所能做到最高的事。失敗一次則讓所有人蒙羞。</DMS_Operations_Venerated.description>
+  
+  <!-- EN: necessary -->
+  <DMS_Operations_Necessary.label>必要</DMS_Operations_Necessary.label>
+  <!-- EN: Nobody enjoys it. We do it because the alternative is worse, and we expect it to be done properly when it has to be done. -->
+  <DMS_Operations_Necessary.description>軍事行動並不愉快，但有其必要，而且該做就要做得像樣。</DMS_Operations_Necessary.description>
+  
+  <!-- EN: abhorrent -->
+  <DMS_Operations_Abhorrent.label>憎惡</DMS_Operations_Abhorrent.label>
+  <!-- EN: To call down fire on a target you cannot see is an abhorrent act. There is no telling what else is down there. -->
+  <DMS_Operations_Abhorrent.description>對一個看不見的目標叫下火力是令人憎惡的行為，天知道那裡還有什麼別的。</DMS_Operations_Abhorrent.description>
+  
+  <!-- EN: venerated -->
+  <DMS_SealedTech_Venerated.label>崇尚</DMS_SealedTech_Venerated.label>
+  <!-- EN: To unlock the unknown is the human instinct that drives progress. -->
+  <DMS_SealedTech_Venerated.description>解密未知是人類邁向進步的天性。</DMS_SealedTech_Venerated.description>
+  
+  <!-- EN: acceptable -->
+  <DMS_SealedTech_Acceptable.label>可接受</DMS_SealedTech_Acceptable.label>
+  <!-- EN: Sealed technology is useful, but its risks still deserve caution. -->
+  <DMS_SealedTech_Acceptable.description>封存科技很有用，仍應該謹慎地對待它存在的風險。</DMS_SealedTech_Acceptable.description>
+  
+  <!-- EN: forbidden -->
+  <DMS_SealedTech_Forbidden.label>禁忌</DMS_SealedTech_Forbidden.label>
+  <!-- EN: Sealed technology was shelved for a reason, and we should never dig it back up. -->
+  <DMS_SealedTech_Forbidden.description>封存科技被束之高閣是有其理由的，而我們永遠不該把它挖出來。</DMS_SealedTech_Forbidden.description>
+  
+  <!-- EN: venerated -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticLife_Venerated.label>崇尚</DMS_SyntheticLife_Venerated.label>
+  <!-- EN: Flesh is a first draft. What comes out of a gestation pod was designed on purpose, and what comes out of a reaction chamber is food that was designed on purpose too. -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticLife_Venerated.description>人造生命勝過血肉，合成食品也勝過肉類。</DMS_SyntheticLife_Venerated.description>
+  
+  <!-- EN: acceptable -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticLife_Acceptable.label>可接受</DMS_SyntheticLife_Acceptable.label>
+  <!-- EN: It is equipment that happens to be wet. Nobody needs to have feelings about equipment. -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticLife_Acceptable.description>人造生命只是裝備，無關緊要。</DMS_SyntheticLife_Acceptable.description>
+  
+  <!-- EN: abhorrent -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticLife_Abhorrent.label>憎惡</DMS_SyntheticLife_Abhorrent.label>
+  <!-- EN: A body is for carrying a person. Using one as a factory for something that was never going to be a person is the worst thing this technology has been put to, and eating what the same machines produce is not far behind. -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticLife_Abhorrent.description>在活人身體裡長出機器是令人憎惡的行為，吃下那些機器產出的東西同樣可恥。</DMS_SyntheticLife_Abhorrent.description>
+  
+</LanguageData>

