   <!-- EN: An advanced artificial leg. With its biogel nerve-link, powerful mini-servos, and lattice-dust healing system, it is better than a biological leg in almost every way. -->
   <DMS_SyntheticLeg.description>一種先進的人造腿。由生長在鎢鋼骨骼上的人工肌肉和塑鋼纖維皮膚組成。</DMS_SyntheticLeg.description>
   
+  <!-- EN: Biosynthetic eye -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticEye.label>生物合成眼</DMS_SyntheticEye.label>
+  <!-- EN: A compact compound eye cultured on an artifuscle framework. Its three primary lenses each carry receptors for a different band of the spectrum, and a micro-processor merges their input into visual signals the brain can understand, giving it far greater visual capability than a natural eye. -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticEye.description>一種以人工肌腱組織為框架培養而成的緊湊複眼。三枚主眼各自具備不同光譜波段的受體，並由微型處理器合成為大腦能夠理解的視覺訊號，因此視覺能力遠勝天然眼球。</DMS_SyntheticEye.description>
+  
+  <!-- EN: Biosynthetic heart -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticHeart.label>生物合成心臟</DMS_SyntheticHeart.label>
+  <!-- EN: A heart grown from engineered sauropsid cardiac muscle around a plasfiber valve lattice, designed for augmented soldiers whose oxygen demand had long outstripped what a natural heart could deliver. Its tireless beat comes at the price of occasional immune rejection. -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticHeart.description>以基因改造的蜥形綱心肌包覆塑鋼纖維瓣膜晶格培養而成的心臟，專為供氧需求早已超出天然心臟負荷的改造士兵所研發。它不知疲倦地搏動，代價則是偶發的免疫排斥。</DMS_SyntheticHeart.description>
+  
+  <!-- EN: Biosynthetic lung -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticLung.label>生物合成肺</DMS_SyntheticLung.label>
+  <!-- EN: A cultured lung whose alveoli are lined with an artificial filtration membrane. Unlike the mechanical membrane lung, it breathes exactly like living tissue, and filters out part of the airborne toxins before they reach the bloodstream. -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticLung.description>肺泡內壁覆有人工過濾膜的培養肺臟。與機械膜肺不同，它的呼吸方式與活體組織別無二致，並能在部分空氣毒素進入血液前將其濾除。</DMS_SyntheticLung.description>
+  
+  <!-- EN: Biosynthetic kidney -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticKidney.label>生物合成腎</DMS_SyntheticKidney.label>
+  <!-- EN: A cultured kidney whose nephrons are reinforced with synthetic filter fibers. It cleans the blood faster than natural tissue and noticeably speeds up the body's immune response to infection. -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticKidney.description>以合成過濾纖維強化腎元的培養腎臟。淨化血液的速度勝過天然組織，並能明顯加快身體對感染的免疫反應。</DMS_SyntheticKidney.description>
+  
+  <!-- EN: Biosynthetic liver -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticLiver.label>生物合成肝</DMS_SyntheticLiver.label>
+  <!-- EN: A liver grown on a porous artifuscle framework and seeded with engineered enzyme cultures. It breaks down toxins and spoiled food far more efficiently than a natural liver. -->
+  <DMS_SyntheticLiver.description>在多孔人工肌腱框架上培養並植入工程酵素菌株的肝臟。分解毒素與腐敗食物的效率遠勝天然肝臟。</DMS_SyntheticLiver.description>
+  
 </LanguageData>

