+  <DMS_Make_Dogge.description>Gestate a Dogge Automatroid, a four-legged machine gun platform. The synthetic muscle bundles in its limbs give it uncommon cross-country mobility, and its low profile suits it to providing accompanying fire across open ground - it is usually used to mop up routed enemies and for counter-guerrilla work.\n\nIt keeps both an auto-engaging fixed machine gun turret and a separate weapon hardpoint that will take a flamethrower for close work, and it moves fast enough to keep pace with any advance. Culturing the synthetic muscle is expensive, its plating only handles fragments and small calibers, and the hardpoint will not accept a long-barrelled weapon. The Dogge is well suited to running down fast-moving light guerrillas and escaping prisoners, and it can also carry anti-tank rockets to punch above its weight in street fighting.</DMS_Make_Dogge.description>
