+  <DMS_Make_Sergeant.description>Gestate a Sergeant Automatroid, the relay-command conversion of the Soldat, recognizable by the dish-shaped omnidirectional radar and transceiver mast on its back. Its job is to organize scattered units into a combined automatroid battlegroup (CAB), and to hold the command chain open on behalf of the mechanitor when they cannot move up in person.\n\nIts relay radius far exceeds the Noctula's and extends control into neighboring maps, and the identification code on its T/R transceiver can be used to request Soldat and Falcon reinforcement drops from synchronous orbit. The mass and processing load of the radar assembly cost four times the Soldat's bandwidth, however, and leave it slower, thinner-skinned, and able to carry nothing heavier than a sidearm for self-defense. When a Sergeant is destroyed, every link in the command chain it was holding open goes down with it.</DMS_Make_Sergeant.description>
