+  <DMS_GestaltEngine.description>A super-large computing core for commanding automatroids in large-scale combat, capable of independently commanding and sustaining an entire combined combat brigade. Before the Next Generation War, countless cores like this directly or indirectly commanded nearly ninety percent of Earth's regular armies - and in the end, under five AIs each holding its own domain, nearly half of Earth's land and sea became a war zone between them.</DMS_GestaltEngine.description>
