+    且完全不使用 FFF_Element_Roof* 元素。
+
+    為什麼要這樣做（重要）：
+      FFF_StructureUtility.SpawnTerrain 會在每一個要鋪設地形的格子上
+      摧毀 building.isNaturalRock 的物件；DMS_Ruin_A~I 動輒鋪設數百格
+      PackedDirt/Concrete 庭院，若直接拿來當邊緣散布，會在山體站點裡
+      一次剷掉大片天然岩石。
+      同理，FFF_Element_RoofRect 的 force 預設為 true，Task_ApplyRoof 在
+      force=true 時會蓋掉 isThickRoof 的厚岩頂。
+      因此本檔的所有變體：地形只鋪建物腳下的小塊，且不含屋頂元素，
+      生成檢查（SpawnTerrain / Task_ApplyRoof）不會大範圍改動地形與岩頂。
+
+    Large outer ruins for the decoy site's edge scatter. Same asset vocabulary as
+    Ruin_ScatteredSmall.xml, but deliberately terrain-light: each variant keeps its
+    total TerrainRect area under ~20 cells and uses no FFF_Element_Roof* elements.
+
+    Rationale: FFF_StructureUtility.SpawnTerrain destroys any isNaturalRock building
+    on every cell it paints, and FFF_Element_RoofRect defaults to force=true, which
+    Task_ApplyRoof uses to overwrite isThickRoof cells. DMS_Ruin_A~I paint hundreds
+    of courtyard cells each, so reusing them verbatim would bulldoze large areas of
+    natural rock and thick roof on mountainous site maps. These variants do not.
+
+    用法 Usage：由 GenStep 的 satelliteScatter 依地圖尺寸放置，不寫在主結構佈局裡
+    （見 Defs/Quests/DMS_DecoySiteQuest.xml 的 DMS_DecoySiteStructure）：
