+    <arrivedLetter>You have arrived at the derelict station. A remnant detachment is dug in among the ruins.\n\nThe station is large and the garrison is spread out; expect them to converge once the shooting starts.</arrivedLetter>
+    <arrivedLetterDef>NegativeEvent</arrivedLetterDef>
+    <tags>
+      <li>DMS_SiteStationSite</li>
+    </tags>
+  </SitePartDef>
+
+  <GenStepDef>
+    <defName>DMS_SiteStationStructure</defName>
+    <linkWithSite>DMS_SiteStationSite</linkWithSite>
+    <order>400</order>
+    <genStep Class="Fortified.Structures.GenStep_FFFGarrisonedStructure">
+      <useTag>DMS_SiteStation</useTag>
+      <randomOffset>0~2</randomOffset>
+      <filthTypes>
+        <li>Filth_RubbleBuilding</li>
+        <li>Filth_RubbleRock</li>
+        <li>Filth_MachineBits</li>
+        <li>Filth_Ash</li>
+      </filthTypes>
+      <debrisDef>ChunkSlagSteel</debrisDef>
+      <debrisCount>14~22</debrisCount>
+      <scatterRadius>36</scatterRadius>
+      <lootMaker>MapGen_DefaultStockpile</lootMaker>
+      <!-- 版面自帶的 PawnGroup 之外，再依站點威脅點數生成一支守軍（LordJob_DefendPoint），
+           讓兵力隨難度縮放；[enemiesCount] 對應的就是這一支。
+           On top of the layout's own PawnGroup, spawn a garrison from the site's threat points
+           (LordJob_DefendPoint) so strength scales with difficulty; [enemiesCount] describes this group. -->
+      <spawnDefenders>true</spawnDefenders>
+      <defendRadius>26</defendRadius>
+      <!-- 主結構已佔去地圖中央大半，衛星只放外圈。
+           The main structure eats most of the centre; satellites go on the outer ring only. -->
+      <satelliteScatter>
+        <li>
+          <tag>DMS_RuinSatellite</tag>
+          <count>4~6</count>
+          <radiusPct>0.26</radiusPct>
+          <minRadius>58</minRadius>
+          <minSpacing>5</minSpacing>
+        </li>
+        <li>
+          <tag>DMS_RuinScattered</tag>
+          <count>1~2</count>
+          <radiusPct>0.36</radiusPct>
+          <minRadius>72</minRadius>
+          <minSpacing>6</minSpacing>
+        </li>
+      </satelliteScatter>
+    </genStep>
+  </GenStepDef>
+
+  <!-- 任務腳本在 DMS_LegacyInstallationQuest.xml：五座設施共用一個 QuestScriptDef，隨機抽一座。
+       The quest script lives in DMS_LegacyInstallationQuest.xml: one QuestScriptDef rolls one of the five installations. -->
+
+</Defs>

--- DMS1/NewContent/Defs/Quests/DMS_LegacySite_VaultStation.xml

+++ DMS2/NewContent/Defs/Quests/DMS_LegacySite_VaultStation.xml

@@ -0,0 +1,108 @@

+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
+<Defs>
+
+  <!-- ============================================================
+       儲存庫地面站：軍事儲存庫（DMS_MilitaryVault 口袋地圖）的地表入口。
+       版面（DMS_VaultStation）放的是封板狀態的貨運電梯 DMS_VaultElevator_Sealed，
+       以 FFF_Element_LinkAccessKeyWanter 連到控制室的 DMS_VaultConsole：
+       駭入控制台 → 封板退開 → 換成可進入的 DMS_VaultElevator（已視為駭入）。
+       這是目前唯一會在世界上放置儲存庫入口的流程。
+
+       Vault access station: the surface entrance to the military storage vault
+       (the DMS_MilitaryVault pocket map). The layout (DMS_VaultStation) places
+       the sealed pad DMS_VaultElevator_Sealed, linked to the DMS_VaultConsole in
+       the control room: hack the console → cover retracts → swaps to an enterable,
+       pre-hacked DMS_VaultElevator. This is currently the only worldgen path that
+       places a vault entrance.
+       ============================================================ -->
+
+  <SitePartDef>
+    <defName>DMS_VaultStationSite</defName>
+    <label>vault access station</label>
+    <description>A Legacy remnant surface station built over a buried military storage vault. The freight elevator is locked under an armored cover plate that only the access console beside it can raise, and the console answers to a key-card.</description>
+    <workerClass>Fortified.SitePartWorker_FFF_TimedHostileSite</workerClass>
+    <modExtensions>
+      <li Class="Fortified.FFF_TimedSiteExtension">
+        <baseEntryHours>36</baseEntryHours>
+        <minEntryHours>8</minEntryHours>
+        <maxEntryHours>72</maxEntryHours>
+        <entryLetterLabelKey>DMS_VaultStation_EntryCountdownLabel</entryLetterLabelKey>
+        <entryLetterTextKey>DMS_VaultStation_EntryCountdownText</entryLetterTextKey>
+      </li>
+    </modExtensions>
+    <!-- 世界地圖上用先鋒殘餘的陣營圖標，套陣營色。The Legacy faction icon on the world map, tinted with the faction colour. -->
+    <siteTexture>UI/Faction/LegacyIcon</siteTexture>
+    <expandingIconTexture>UI/Faction/LegacyIcon</expandingIconTexture>
+    <applyFactionColorToSiteTexture>true</applyFactionColorToSiteTexture>
+    <showFactionInInspectString>true</showFactionInInspectString>
+    <requiresFaction>true</requiresFaction>
+    <wantsThreatPoints>true</wantsThreatPoints>
+    <gravShipsCanLandOn>true</gravShipsCanLandOn>
+    <minThreatPoints>600</minThreatPoints>
+    <considerEnteringAsAttack>true</considerEnteringAsAttack>
+    <disallowsAutomaticDetectionTimerStart>true</disallowsAutomaticDetectionTimerStart>
+    <approachOrderString>Assault {0}</approachOrderString>
+    <approachingReportString>Assaulting {0}.</approachingReportString>
+    <arrivedLetter>You have arrived at the vault access station. A remnant garrison holds the compound.\n\nThe freight elevator is sealed under its cover plate. Swipe an access key-card at the access console beside it to raise the plate.</arrivedLetter>
+    <arrivedLetterDef>NegativeEvent</arrivedLetterDef>
+    <tags>
+      <li>DMS_VaultStationSite</li>
+    </tags>
+  </SitePartDef>
+
+  <GenStepDef>
+    <defName>DMS_VaultStationStructure</defName>
+    <linkWithSite>DMS_VaultStationSite</linkWithSite>
+    <order>400</order>
+    <genStep Class="Fortified.Structures.GenStep_FFFGarrisonedStructure">
+      <useTag>DMS_VaultStation</useTag>
+      <randomOffset>0~3</randomOffset>
+      <filthTypes>
+        <li>Filth_RubbleBuilding</li>
+        <li>Filth_MachineBits</li>
+        <li>Filth_Ash</li>
+      </filthTypes>
+      <!-- 不設 centerpiece：保底生成的封板電梯不會連到任何控制台，永遠打不開；
+           版面 47x51 在站點地圖上不會被裁切。
+           No centerpiece: a fallback sealed pad would have no console link and could never open;
+           the 47x51 layout never gets clipped on a site map anyway. -->
+      <debrisDef>ChunkSlagSteel</debrisDef>
+      <debrisCount>6~12</debrisCount>
+      <scatterRadius>26</scatterRadius>
+      <lootMaker>MapGen_DefaultStockpile</lootMaker>
+      <!-- 版面自帶的 PawnGroup 之外，再依站點威脅點數生成一支守軍（LordJob_DefendPoint），
+           讓兵力隨難度縮放；[enemiesCount] 對應的就是這一支。
+           On top of the layout's own PawnGroup, spawn a garrison from the site's threat points
+           (LordJob_DefendPoint) so strength scales with difficulty; [enemiesCount] describes this group. -->
+      <spawnDefenders>true</spawnDefenders>
+      <defendRadius>20</defendRadius>
+      <satelliteScatter>
+        <li>
+          <tag>DMS_DecoySiteEdgeRuin</tag>
+          <count>1~2</count>
+          <radiusPct>0.22</radiusPct>
+          <minRadius>38</minRadius>
+          <minSpacing>6</minSpacing>
+        </li>
+        <li>
+          <tag>DMS_RuinSatellite</tag>
+          <count>4~6</count>
+          <radiusPct>0.18</radiusPct>
+          <minRadius>34</minRadius>
+          <minSpacing>5</minSpacing>
+        </li>
+        <li>
+          <tag>DMS_RuinScattered</tag>
+          <count>2</count>
+          <radiusPct>0.32</radiusPct>
+          <minRadius>46</minRadius>
+          <minSpacing>6</minSpacing>
+        </li>
+      </satelliteScatter>
+    </genStep>
+  </GenStepDef>
+
+  <!-- 任務腳本在 DMS_LegacyInstallationQuest.xml：五座設施共用一個 QuestScriptDef，隨機抽一座。
+       The quest script lives in DMS_LegacyInstallationQuest.xml: one QuestScriptDef rolls one of the five installations. -->
+
+</Defs>

--- DMS1/NewContent/Defs/Quests/DMS_PirateAssemblyQuest.xml

+++ DMS2/NewContent/Defs/Quests/DMS_PirateAssemblyQuest.xml

@@ -0,0 +1,336 @@

+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
+<Defs>
+
+  <SitePartDef>
+    <defName>DMS_PirateAssemblySite</defName>
+    <label>pirate assembly yard</label>
+    <description>An old automatroid assembly yard, seized by pirates and put back into service. The machines coming off the line are their own.</description>
+    <workerClass>Fortified.SitePartWorker_FFF_TimedHostileSite</workerClass>
+    <modExtensions>
+      <li Class="Fortified.FFF_TimedSiteExtension">
+        <baseEntryHours>28</baseEntryHours>
+        <minEntryHours>6</minEntryHours>
+        <maxEntryHours>60</maxEntryHours>
+        <entryLetterLabelKey>DMS_PirateAssembly_EntryCountdownLabel</entryLetterLabelKey>
+        <entryLetterTextKey>DMS_PirateAssembly_EntryCountdownText</entryLetterTextKey>
+      </li>
+    </modExtensions>
+    <siteTexture>World/WorldObjects/Sites/Outpost</siteTexture>
+    <expandingIconTexture>World/WorldObjects/Expanding/Sites/Outpost</expandingIconTexture>
+    <applyFactionColorToSiteTexture>true</applyFactionColorToSiteTexture>
+    <showFactionInInspectString>true</showFactionInInspectString>
+    <requiresFaction>true</requiresFaction>
+    <wantsThreatPoints>true</wantsThreatPoints>
+    <!-- 與原版 Outpost 一致，否則重力船無法降落在這個突襲目標上。
+         Matches vanilla Outpost; without it a gravship cannot land here. -->
+    <gravShipsCanLandOn>true</gravShipsCanLandOn>
+    <minThreatPoints>400</minThreatPoints>
+    <considerEnteringAsAttack>true</considerEnteringAsAttack>
+    <!-- 倒數由 SitePartWorker_FFF_TimedHostileSite 自行以難度縮放啟動。
+         The worker starts its own difficulty-scaled countdown. -->
+    <disallowsAutomaticDetectionTimerStart>true</disallowsAutomaticDetectionTimerStart>
+    <approachOrderString>Attack {0}</approachOrderString>
+    <approachingReportString>Attacking {0}.</approachingReportString>
+    <arrivedLetter>You have arrived at the pirate assembly yard.\n\nOnce the crew raise the alarm, enemy reinforcements will begin to arrive.</arrivedLetter>
+    <arrivedLetterDef>NegativeEvent</arrivedLetterDef>
+    <tags>
+      <li>DMS_PirateAssembly</li>
+    </tags>
+  </SitePartDef>
+
+  <GenStepDef>
+    <defName>DMS_PirateAssemblyStructure</defName>
+    <linkWithSite>DMS_PirateAssemblySite</linkWithSite>
+    <order>400</order>
+    <genStep Class="Fortified.Structures.GenStep_FFFGarrisonedStructure">
+      <!-- 透過 IFFF 從帶此標籤的結構中隨機挑選；目前只有 Site_PirateAssembly。
+           Picks a random IFFF structure carrying this tag. -->
+      <useTag>DMS_PirateAssembly</useTag>
+      <randomOffset>0~3</randomOffset>
+      <filthTypes>
+        <li>Filth_RubbleBuilding</li>
+        <li>Filth_MachineBits</li>
+        <li>Filth_Ash</li>
+      </filthTypes>
+      <!-- 佈局本身已含所有機兵支架，不需要額外的中央件。
+           The layout already carries every cradle; no centerpiece needed. -->
+      <debrisDef>ChunkSlagSteel</debrisDef>
+      <debrisCount>10~18</debrisCount>
+      <scatterRadius>26</scatterRadius>
+      <lootMaker>MapGen_DefaultStockpile</lootMaker>
+      <spawnDefenders>true</spawnDefenders>
+      <defendRadius>20</defendRadius>
+      <satelliteScatter>
+        <li>
+          <tag>DMS_RuinSatellite</tag>
+          <count>3</count>
+          <radiusPct>0.18</radiusPct>
+          <minRadius>24</minRadius>
+          <minSpacing>5</minSpacing>
+        </li>
+        <li>
+          <tag>DMS_RuinScattered</tag>
+          <count>1</count>
+          <radiusPct>0.32</radiusPct>
+          <minRadius>40</minRadius>
+          <minSpacing>6</minSpacing>
+        </li>
+      </satelliteScatter>
+    </genStep>
+  </GenStepDef>
+
+  <!-- ==================== 任務腳本 Quest script ====================
+
+       單一 Def 處理兩種版本，做法照 Core 的 OpportunitySite_ItemStash：
+       用 QuestNode_RandomNode 擲骰決定要不要有委託人（asker）。
+
+       ・沒有委託人：自行截獲情報，戰利品自取，沒有酬勞。
+         擲中時設 askerIsNull=true 這個 slate 變數。
+       ・有委託人：中立人類派系的領袖出面委託，完成後可挑選獎勵。
+
+       描述文本靠語法常數分流（askerIsNull==true / asker_factionLeader==True），
+       任務名稱則靠 priority：[asker_nameDef] 在沒有委託人時無法解析，
+       規則會自動退回沒有 priority 的那幾條。兩種機制都是原版的用法。
+
+       其餘結構照 OpportunitySite_BanditCamp：取地點 → 依威脅點數算酬勞
+       → 生成站點 → 逾期／清空的訊號分支。
+
+       One def, two variants, following Core's OpportunitySite_ItemStash:
+       QuestNode_RandomNode rolls for whether there is an asker.
+
+       - No asker: intercepted intel, loot only, no payment. Sets the
+         askerIsNull slate var when this branch wins.
+       - Asker: a neutral humanlike faction leader hires the player, with a
+         choice of reward on completion.
+
+       Description text branches on grammar constants; the quest name branches
+       on rule priority, since [asker_nameDef] cannot resolve without an asker
+       and the resolver falls back to the unprioritised rules. Both are vanilla
+       mechanisms. The rest mirrors OpportunitySite_BanditCamp.
+       ==================================================================== -->
+
+  <QuestScriptDef>
+    <defName>DMS_PirateAssemblyRaid</defName>
+    <successHistoryEvent>DMS_QuestSuccess_Military</successHistoryEvent>
+    <failedOrExpiredHistoryEvent>DMS_QuestFailed_Military</failedOrExpiredHistoryEvent>
+    <!-- 隨機事件：由敘事者依權重挑選發布。權重 1.0 與原版 bandit camp 同級，
+         也等於合併前兩份定義（0.6 + 0.4）的總和。
+         Random incident offered by the storyteller. 1.0 matches vanilla bandit
+         camp and preserves the combined weight of the two defs this replaces. -->
+    <rootSelectionWeight>1.0</rootSelectionWeight>
+    <rootMinPoints>500</rootMinPoints>
+    <canGiveRoyalFavor>true</canGiveRoyalFavor>
+    <expireDaysRange>4~8</expireDaysRange>
+    <questNameRules>
+      <rulesStrings>
+        <!-- priority=1 的兩條需要委託人；沒有委託人時 [asker_nameDef] 解析失敗，
+             自動落到下面那條。
+             The priority=1 rules need an asker; without one [asker_nameDef]
+             fails to resolve and the plain rule is used instead. -->
+        <li>questName(priority=1)->[asker_nameDef] and the [yard]</li>
+        <li>questName(priority=1)->The [yard] Contract</li>
+        <li>questName->[bandit] [yard]</li>
+        <li>bandit->Pirate</li>
+        <li>bandit->Raider</li>
+        <li>bandit->Outlaw</li>
+        <li>bandit->Marauder</li>
+        <li>yard->Assembly Yard</li>
+        <li>yard->Mech Works</li>
+        <li>yard->Foundry</li>
+      </rulesStrings>
+    </questNameRules>
+    <questDescriptionRules>
+      <rulesStrings>
+        <!-- 無委託人 / No asker -->
+        <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==true)->We've intercepted messages about an old automatroid assembly yard not far from [map_definite]. A [siteFaction_name] crew has seized it and put the line back into service. The machines coming off it are being built for their own raids.\n\nThe yard is defended by (*Threat)[enemiesCount] [enemiesLabel](/Threat).\n\nWhatever is still on the assembly racks is ours for the taking. Units that have not been finished never had their command authentication locked, so a mechanitor with spare bandwidth can hack one and take control of it.\n\nEntering the yard will alert the crew, and enemy reinforcements will arrive some time later.</li>
+
+        <!-- 派系領袖委託 / Faction leader asker -->
+        <li>questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)->[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has sent us a message. A [siteFaction_name] crew has seized an old automatroid assembly yard nearby and put the line back into service. Every machine it turns out is one more that will be hitting [asker_faction_name] caravans.\n\n[asker_nameDef] is asking us to shut the yard down, which means eliminating all enemies and turrets. It is defended by (*Threat)[enemiesCount] [enemiesLabel](/Threat).\n\nWhatever is still on the assembly racks is ours to keep. Units that have not been finished never had their command authentication locked, so a mechanitor with spare bandwidth can hack one and take control of it.\n\nEntering the yard will alert the crew, and enemy reinforcements will arrive some time later.</li>
+      </rulesStrings>
+    </questDescriptionRules>
+    <root Class="QuestNode_Sequence">
+      <nodes>
+        <li Class="QuestNode_SubScript">
+          <def>Util_RandomizePointsChallengeRating</def>
+          <parms>
+            <pointsFactorTwoStar>1.5</pointsFactorTwoStar>
+            <pointsFactorThreeStar>2</pointsFactorThreeStar>
+          </parms>
+        </li>
+
+        <li Class="QuestNode_SubScript">
+          <def>Util_AdjustPointsForDistantFight</def>
+        </li>
+
+        <li Class="QuestNode_GetMap">
+          <canBeSpace>true</canBeSpace>
+        </li>
+
+        <!-- 兩種版本的分岔點。外層 IsSet 讓外部（例如除錯或其他腳本）
+             預先塞入 asker 時不被覆蓋。
+             The branch point. The outer IsSet lets an externally supplied
+             asker survive, matching vanilla. -->
+        <li Class="QuestNode_IsSet">
+          <name>asker</name>
+          <elseNode Class="QuestNode_RandomNode">
+            <nodes>
+              <li Class="QuestNode_Set">
+                <name>askerIsNull</name>
+                <value>true</value>
+                <selectionWeight>0.4</selectionWeight>
+              </li>
+              <li Class="QuestNode_GetPawn">
+                <storeAs>asker</storeAs>
+                <mustBeFactionLeader>true</mustBeFactionLeader>
+                <mustBeNonHostileToPlayer>true</mustBeNonHostileToPlayer>
+                <allowPermanentEnemyFaction>false</allowPermanentEnemyFaction>
+                <selectionWeight>0.6</selectionWeight>
+              </li>
+            </nodes>
+          </elseNode>
+        </li>
+
+        <li Class="QuestNode_GetSiteTile">
+          <storeAs>siteTile</storeAs>
+          <preferCloserTiles>true</preferCloserTiles>
+        </li>
+
+        <!-- 站點派系由此節點挑選。刻意不加 mustBeHostileToFactionOf：
+             無委託人的版本沒有 asker 可以當基準，照 ItemStash 的做法留空。
+             The site faction comes from this node. mustBeHostileToFactionOf is
+             deliberately omitted: the no-asker variant has no pawn to key off,
+             so this follows ItemStash and leaves it unset. -->
+        <li Class="QuestNode_GetSitePartDefsByTagsAndFaction">
+          <storeAs>sitePartDefs</storeAs>
+          <storeFactionAs>siteFaction</storeFactionAs>
+          <sitePartsTags>
+            <li><tag>DMS_PirateAssembly</tag></li>
+          </sitePartsTags>
+        </li>
+
+        <li Class="QuestNode_GetDefaultSitePartsParams">
+          <tile>$siteTile</tile>
+          <faction>$siteFaction</faction>
+          <sitePartDefs>$sitePartDefs</sitePartDefs>
+          <storeSitePartsParamsAs>sitePartsParams</storeSitePartsParamsAs>
+        </li>
+
+        <!-- 酬勞依實際生成的威脅點數計算：SitePartDef 的 minThreatPoints
+             可能把實際點數推高於任務輸入的 points。
+             Reward is based on the threat points actually generated; the
+             SitePartDef's minThreatPoints floor can raise them. -->
+        <li Class="QuestNode_GetSiteThreatPoints">
+          <storeAs>sitePoints</storeAs>
+          <sitePartsParams>$sitePartsParams</sitePartsParams>
+        </li>
+
+        <li Class="QuestNode_SubScript">
+          <def>Util_GetDefaultRewardValueFromPoints</def>
+          <parms>
+            <points>$sitePoints</points>
+          </parms>
+        </li>
+
+        <li Class="QuestNode_Multiply">
+          <value1>$rewardValue</value1>
+          <value2>1.75</value2>
+          <storeAs>rewardValue</storeAs>
+        </li>
+
+        <li Class="QuestNode_SubScript">
+          <def>Util_GenerateSite</def>
+        </li>
+
+        <li Class="QuestNode_SpawnWorldObjects">
+          <worldObjects>$site</worldObjects>
+        </li>
+
+        <li Class="QuestNode_WorldObjectTimeout">
+          <worldObject>$site</worldObject>
+          <isQuestTimeout>true</isQuestTimeout>
+          <delayTicks>$(randInt(10,22)*60000)</delayTicks>
+          <inSignalDisable>site.MapGenerated</inSignalDisable>
+          <destroyOnCleanup>true</destroyOnCleanup>
+          <node Class="QuestNode_Sequence">
+            <nodes>
+              <li Class="QuestNode_Letter">
+                <label TKey="LetterLabelQuestExpired">Quest expired: [resolvedQuestName]</label>
+                <text TKey="LetterTextQuestExpired">The crew have stripped the assembly line out of the yard and moved it elsewhere. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has expired.</text>
+              </li>
+              <li Class="QuestNode_End">
+                <outcome>Fail</outcome>
+              </li>
+            </nodes>
+          </node>
+        </li>
+
+        <!-- 進去又撤走導致地圖被移除：任務失敗。
+             Entering and then abandoning the map fails the quest. -->
+        <li Class="QuestNode_Signal">
+          <inSignal>site.Destroyed</inSignal>
+          <node Class="QuestNode_Sequence">
+            <nodes>
+              <li Class="QuestNode_Letter">
+                <label TKey="LetterLabelQuestFailed">Quest failed: [resolvedQuestName]</label>
+                <text TKey="LetterTextQuestFailed">The yard crew scattered after being discovered, taking the line with them. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has ended.</text>
+              </li>
+              <li Class="QuestNode_End">
+                <outcome>Fail</outcome>
+              </li>
+            </nodes>
+          </node>
+        </li>
+
+        <li Class="QuestNode_Signal">
+          <inSignal>site.AllEnemiesDefeated</inSignal>
+          <node Class="QuestNode_Sequence">
+            <nodes>
+              <li Class="QuestNode_Notify_PlayerRaidedSomeone">
+                <getRaidersFromMapParent>$site</getRaidersFromMapParent>
+              </li>
+              <!-- 只有委託版本付酬。這裡用 askerIsNull 的 elseNode 反向判斷，
+                   等同「有委託人才給獎勵」。
+                   QuestNode_GiveRewards 產生的 QuestPart_Choice 就是任務卡上
+                   讓玩家挑選的獎勵組。
+
+                   Only the commissioned variant pays. Keying off askerIsNull's
+                   elseNode is the inverse test: "reward only if there is an
+                   asker". QuestNode_GiveRewards emits the QuestPart_Choice that
+                   renders as the selectable reward group on the quest card. -->
+              <li Class="QuestNode_IsSet">
+                <name>askerIsNull</name>
+                <elseNode Class="QuestNode_GiveRewards">
+                  <parms>
+                    <allowGoodwill>true</allowGoodwill>
+                    <allowRoyalFavor>true</allowRoyalFavor>
+                    <chosenPawnSignal>ChosenPawnForReward</chosenPawnSignal>
+                  </parms>
+                  <addCampLootReward>true</addCampLootReward>
+                  <customLetterLabel TKey="LetterLabelPaymentArrived">Payment arrived</customLetterLabel>
+                  <customLetterText TKey="LetterTextPaymentArrived">The assembly yard has been shut down.\n\nThe payment from [asker_faction_name] has arrived.</customLetterText>
+                  <nodeIfChosenPawnSignalUsed Class="QuestNode_Letter">
+                    <letterDef>ChoosePawn</letterDef>
+                    <label TKey="LetterLabelFavorReceiver">[asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]</label>
+                    <text TKey="LetterTextFavorReceiver">These colonists took part in clearing the yard for the quest [resolvedQuestName]. [asker_definite] wants to know who should receive the [royalFavorReward_amount] [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] for this service.</text>
+                    <useColonistsOnMap>$site</useColonistsOnMap>
+                    <chosenPawnSignal>ChosenPawnForReward</chosenPawnSignal>
+                  </nodeIfChosenPawnSignalUsed>
+                </elseNode>
+              </li>
+            </nodes>
+          </node>
+        </li>
+
+        <!-- QuestNode_End 必須排在 GiveRewards 之後：QuestPart 依加入順序
+             處理訊號，任務先結束的話獎勵部件就收不到訊號了。
+             QuestNode_End must come after GiveRewards: QuestParts handle signals
+             in the order they were added, and ending first cuts the reward off. -->
+        <li Class="QuestNode_End">
+          <inSignal>site.AllEnemiesDefeated</inSignal>
+          <outcome>Success</outcome>
+        </li>
+      </nodes>
+    </root>
+  </QuestScriptDef>
+
+</Defs>

--- DMS1/NewContent/Defs/Quests/DMS_Stele.xml

+++ DMS2/NewContent/Defs/Quests/DMS_Stele.xml

@@ -0,0 +1,121 @@

+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
+<Defs>
+
+  <!-- ============================================================
+       石碑任務線（程式在 _Source/DMS/Quests/Stele/）。
+       1. DMS_Stele：主線。研究「量子位元破譯」完成時由 DMS.ModExtension_ResearchQuest 派發（一局一次），
+          說書人不會抽到。陸續派發撞擊地點子任務，直到帶回 keysCount 枚密鑰。
+       2. DMS_SteleKey_ImpactSite：撞擊地點。先鋒殘餘守著墜落的密鑰艙；帶走密鑰即成功，
+          留在站點上（隨地圖消失）即失敗，主線之後會補發。
+       3. DMS_SteleVault：石碑封藏庫。密鑰集齊後解讀並用掉，派發這個最終站點；
+          把石碑（可微縮，500 kg）帶回據點即主線成功。石碑遺失時 3~5 天後指出下一座。
+
+       Stele line (code in _Source/DMS/Quests/Stele/).
+       1. DMS_Stele: main line. Issued once per game by DMS.ModExtension_ResearchQuest when qubit decryption is
+          researched; never picked by the storyteller. Issues impact-site subquests until keysCount glyphs are home.
+       2. DMS_SteleKey_ImpactSite: Legacy remnants hold a crashed glyph capsule. Taking the glyph succeeds; leaving
+          it behind (it vanishes with the map) fails and the main line issues another later.
+       3. DMS_SteleVault: the glyphs are read and spent, then this final site is issued. Bringing the stele
+          (minifiable, 500 kg) home completes the line. A lost stele points to the next vault in 3~5 days.
+       ============================================================ -->
+
+  <QuestScriptDef>
+    <defName>DMS_Stele</defName>
+    <successHistoryEvent>DMS_QuestSuccess_Occultech</successHistoryEvent>
+    <failedOrExpiredHistoryEvent>DMS_QuestFailed_Occultech</failedOrExpiredHistoryEvent>
+    <isRootSpecial>true</isRootSpecial>
+    <autoAccept>true</autoAccept>
+    <defaultChallengeRating>4</defaultChallengeRating>
+    <questNameRules>
+      <rulesStrings>
+        <li>questName->The buried stele</li>
+      </rulesStrings>
+    </questNameRules>
+    <questDescriptionRules>
+      <rulesStrings>
+        <li>questDescription->With qubit decryption, our researchers can now pick up the faint authentication pulses of occultech glyphs: sealed cipher plates the colonial fleets dropped across this world. Each glyph carries one fragment of the key to a stele buried beneath this world, and the fleets scatter them so that no single find can open one.\n\nRecover [keysCount] glyphs and bring them home. Reading a full set will resolve where the stele lies and how to break its seal. Glyph sites will surface over time, and the Legacy remnants assigned to them are still standing guard.\n\nOnce the stele is home, a decoder set flush against it will extract its knowledge.</li>
+      </rulesStrings>
+    </questDescriptionRules>
+    <root Class="DMS.QuestNode_Root_Stele">
+      <steleDef>DMS_OccultTechFont</steleDef>
+      <keysCount>4</keysCount>
+      <vaultQuestDef>DMS_SteleVault</vaultQuestDef>
+      <subquestDefs>
+        <li>DMS_SteleKey_ImpactSite</li>
+      </subquestDefs>
+    </root>
+  </QuestScriptDef>
+
+  <QuestScriptDef>
+    <defName>DMS_SteleKey_ImpactSite</defName>
+    <successHistoryEvent>DMS_QuestSuccess_Occultech</successHistoryEvent>
+    <failedOrExpiredHistoryEvent>DMS_QuestFailed_Occultech</failedOrExpiredHistoryEvent>
+    <autoAccept>true</autoAccept>
+    <questNameRules>
+      <rulesStrings>
+        <li>questName->Impact site</li>
+      </rulesStrings>
+    </questNameRules>
+    <questDescriptionRules>
+      <rulesStrings>
+        <li>questDescription->Our receivers have caught the authentication pulse of an occultech glyph. The fleets deliver glyphs to pioneer installations by orbital drop, and this capsule never reached its beacon: it came down hard, and the pioneers sheltered it where it fell. The Legacy remnants assigned to the impact site are still holding it.\n\nThe glyph is inside the shelter at the centre of the site. Take it and bring it home. If we leave it behind, it will be lost with the site.</li>
+      </rulesStrings>
+    </questDescriptionRules>
+    <questContentRules>
+      <rulesStrings>
+        <li>letterLabelMapGenerated->Glyph capsule wreckage</li>
+        <li>letterTextMapGenerated->Wreckage from the glyph capsule is strewn around the pioneers' shelter, and the remnants guarding it have already noticed us.\n\nThe glyph is inside the shelter. It only counts once it is home.</li>
+      </rulesStrings>
+    </questContentRules>
+    <questAvailableLetterLabel>Occultech glyph found: Impact site</questAvailableLetterLabel>
+    <questAvailableLetterTextIsDescription>true</questAvailableLetterTextIsDescription>
+    <canOccurOnAllPlanetLayers>true</canOccurOnAllPlanetLayers>
+    <root Class="DMS.QuestNode_Root_OccultechKey_Site">
+      <layer>Surface</layer>
+      <sitePartDefs>
+        <li>DMS_SteleKey_ImpactSite</li>
+      </sitePartDefs>
+      <siteFaction>DMS_Legacy</siteFaction>
+    </root>
+  </QuestScriptDef>
+
+  <QuestScriptDef>
+    <defName>DMS_SteleVault</defName>
+    <!-- 成功事件交給主線（同一刻結束），這裡只記失敗。The main line records success (it ends at the same moment); only failure is recorded here. -->
+    <failedOrExpiredHistoryEvent>DMS_QuestFailed_Occultech</failedOrExpiredHistoryEvent>
+    <autoAccept>true</autoAccept>
+    <questNameRules>
+      <rulesStrings>
+        <li>questName->Stele vault</li>
+      </rulesStrings>
+    </questNameRules>
+    <questDescriptionRules>
+      <rulesStrings>
+        <li>questDescription(retry==False)->Our researchers have read the full set of occultech glyphs. The reading collapsed their quantum states and the glyphs are spent, but the cipher they held has resolved: a stele lies buried in a sealed vault at the marked location, still guarded by Legacy remnants.\n\n[vaultInstructions]</li>
+        <li>questDescription(retry==True)->The resolved glyph cipher still holds. With the last stele lost, it points to the next one: another sealed vault under Legacy guard, at the marked location.\n\n[vaultInstructions]</li>
+        <li>vaultInstructions->Clear the vault, claim the stele, uninstall it and bring it home. It weighs [steleMass] kg, so plan the transport. If we leave it behind, it will be lost with the site.</li>
+      </rulesStrings>
+    </questDescriptionRules>
+    <questContentRules>
+      <rulesStrings>
+        <li>letterLabelMapGenerated->Stele vault</li>
+        <li>letterTextMapGenerated->The stele stands at the centre of the vault, and the remnants guarding it are already moving.\n\nOnce the area is clear, claim the stele and uninstall it. It must leave this site with us.</li>
+      </rulesStrings>
+    </questContentRules>
+    <questAvailableLetterLabel>Stele located: Stele vault</questAvailableLetterLabel>
+    <questAvailableLetterTextIsDescription>true</questAvailableLetterTextIsDescription>
+    <canOccurOnAllPlanetLayers>true</canOccurOnAllPlanetLayers>
+    <root Class="DMS.QuestNode_Root_SteleVault">
+      <layer>Surface</layer>
+      <!-- 石碑要運回來，站點放近一點。The stele has to be hauled back, so keep the vault close. -->
+      <distanceFromColonyRange>8~20</distanceFromColonyRange>
+      <pointsFactor>1.25</pointsFactor>
+      <sitePartDefs>
+        <li>DMS_SteleVault</li>
+      </sitePartDefs>
+      <siteFaction>DMS_Legacy</siteFaction>
+      <steleDef>DMS_OccultTechFont</steleDef>
+    </root>
+  </QuestScriptDef>
+
+</Defs>

