+        <crossSectorChance>0.5</crossSectorChance>
+        <!-- 通風中樞：遠離主結構、埋在岩層裡的一座結構，從它的牆上拉通風管道到各分區（接進該分區的管道網，沒有就接到房間或走廊），
+             跟主結構之間只有這些管道相連，兩頭都是通風口。中樞裡的配電櫃也會替它接到的網路供電。
+             Vent centre: a structure buried in the rock well away from the main structure, with vent ducts from its walls
+             out to the sectors (into a sector's duct network, else to one of its rooms or its corridor). Those ducts are its
+             only link to the main structure, with a vent at either end. Its substation cabinet powers the networks it joins. -->
+        <ventCenterStructures>
+          <li>DMS_Room_VentCenter_A</li>
+          <li>DMS_Room_VentCenter_B</li>
+          <li>DMS_Room_VentCenter_C</li>
+        </ventCenterStructures>
+        <ventCenterChance>1</ventCenterChance>
+        <ventCenterDistance>6~24</ventCenterDistance>
+        <ventCenterLinks>2~4</ventCenterLinks>
+        <ventCenterMaxLegLength>80</ventCenterMaxLegLength>
+      </li>
+      <!-- 守墓人巡邏隊（DMS.GravekeeperPatrolPlacement）：五架一組沿走廊樹巡邏、在獎勵房門前停留，能開分區閘門。
+           交戰規則保守：看到入侵者先盤查不開火；被攻擊、入侵者進入管制區（獎勵房、指揮室）或警戒值達 engageAlertLevel 才開火；
+           獎勵房被打開後全設施搜索。不會走進電梯廳。
+           Gravekeeper patrol (DMS.GravekeeperPatrolPlacement): squads of five walk the corridor tree, stop at the treasury
+           door and may open the sector gates. Conservative rules of engagement: an intruder in sight is challenged, not
+           shot; they open fire when attacked, when an intruder enters a restricted room (treasury, command room) or when
+           the alert reaches engageAlertLevel, and sweep the whole facility once the treasury is opened. They never step
+           into the lift lobby. -->
+      <li Class="DMS.ModExtension_GravekeeperPatrol">
+        <squad>
+          <li>
+            <kind>DMS_Mech_Gravekeeper_Sepulturero</kind>
+            <count>2</count>
+          </li>
+          <li>
+            <kind>DMS_Mech_Gravekeeper_Enterrador</kind>
+            <count>2</count>
+          </li>
+          <li>
+            <kind>DMS_Mech_Gravekeeper_Velador</kind>
+            <count>1</count>
+          </li>
+        </squad>
+        <overwatchKinds>
+          <li>DMS_Mech_Gravekeeper_Velador</li>
+        </overwatchKinds>
+        <!-- 每隊從上面五個名額裡隨機抽 1~5 架。Each squad draws 1~5 mechs at random from the five slots above. -->
+        <squadSize>1~5</squadSize>
+        <squadCount>1~5</squadCount>
+        <!-- 指揮綜合體：原本有人駐守的區域指揮中心，防務以常規編制為主，守墓人較少見。
+             Command complex: a regional headquarters that was once manned; its defence is mostly the regular garrison,
+             so gravekeepers are rarer. -->
+        <chance>0.8</chance>
+        <engageAlertLevel>0.6</engageAlertLevel>
+      </li>
+    </modExtensions>
+  </StructureLayoutDef>
+
+  <!-- ============================================================
+       地表入口：指揮中樞貨運電梯。繼承儲存庫電梯（DMS_ElevatorBase），換口袋地圖與駭入難度。
+       目前沒有站點放置它，掛在開發者類別下方便測試。
+       Surface entrance: the command complex freight elevator. Inherits the vault lift (DMS_ElevatorBase) with its
+       own pocket map and hack budget. No site places it yet; it sits in the dev category for testing.
+       ============================================================ -->
+  <ThingDef ParentName="DMS_ElevatorBase">
+    <defName>DMS_CommandComplexElevator</defName>
+    <label>command complex freight elevator</label>
+    <description>The surface lift of a buried command complex. The colony fleet ran its regional operations from here: a whole district of barracks, armories, records halls and command rooms sealed under the rock, with only this lift up top. The car still has power, but its controls are locked behind the fleet's strongest encryption. Hack it to bring the car up.</description>
+    <portal>
