+  <!-- EN: infrasonic trauma -->
+  <DMS_SubsonicTrauma.label>次声波创伤</DMS_SubsonicTrauma.label>
+  <DMS_SubsonicTrauma.description>调谐过的次声波让这个生物的内耳与内脏产生共振，造成恶心、失去方向感，以及找不到任何伤口的深层弥漫性疼痛。听觉越敏锐的生物受害越深，全聋者则完全不受影响。反复暴露会迅速叠加，最严重时光是疼痛就足以使其休克。\n\n症状会在几个小时内自行消退。</DMS_SubsonicTrauma.description>
+  <DMS_SubsonicTrauma.stages.0.label>不适</DMS_SubsonicTrauma.stages.0.label>
+  <DMS_SubsonicTrauma.stages.1.label>晕眩</DMS_SubsonicTrauma.stages.1.label>
+  <DMS_SubsonicTrauma.stages.2.label>剧痛</DMS_SubsonicTrauma.stages.2.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: infrasonic module -->
+  <DMS_SubsonicModule.label>次声波改装模块</DMS_SubsonicModule.label>
+  <DMS_SubsonicModule.description>安装在外壳上的调谐次声波发生器阵列，让机兵能释放一次次声波，使周围的敌对生物陷入剧痛与恐慌。</DMS_SubsonicModule.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: infrasonic rupture（聽覺器官損傷） -->
+  <DMS_InfrasoundRupture.label>次声波撕裂伤</DMS_InfrasoundRupture.label>
+  <DMS_InfrasoundRupture.labelNoun>次声波撕裂伤</DMS_InfrasoundRupture.labelNoun>
+  <DMS_InfrasoundRupture.labelNounPretty>{1}内的{0}</DMS_InfrasoundRupture.labelNounPretty>
+  <DMS_InfrasoundRupture.description>被共振的次声波从内部撕裂的组织。若不加以治疗，可能留下疤痕并造成永久性听力损失。</DMS_InfrasoundRupture.description>
+  <DMS_InfrasoundRupture.comps.HediffComp_TendDuration.labelTendedWell>已处置</DMS_InfrasoundRupture.comps.HediffComp_TendDuration.labelTendedWell>
