+  <DMS_Waterdispenser.description>一台配有冷热水龙头的桶装饮水机，为冰冷的设施带来一点小小的舒适。</DMS_Waterdispenser.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: waiting bench -->
+
+  <DMS_Benches.label>等候长椅</DMS_Benches.label>
