+
+  <DMS_Benches.description>钢架上并排安装着三张软垫座椅，常见于设施的走廊与等候区。坐起来还算舒适。</DMS_Benches.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: air purifier -->
+
+  <DMS_Airpurifier.label>空气净化机</DMS_Airpurifier.label>
