+  <DMS_Airpurifier.description>一台落地式空气净化装置，其滤网能过滤空气中的灰尘与污染物，保持设施房间的清洁。</DMS_Airpurifier.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: hydroponic planter -->
+
+  <DMS_Hydroponics_Flowerpot.label>水培花盆</DMS_Hydroponics_Flowerpot.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A self-contained hydroponic planter with its own nutrient reservoir. Grow decorative flowers here to improve the mood of people nearby. -->
+
+  <DMS_Hydroponics_Flowerpot.description>一个自带营养液储槽的独立式水培花盆。在这里种植观赏花卉可以改善周围人员的心情。</DMS_Hydroponics_Flowerpot.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- ==================== Facility furniture (ruined) ==================== -->
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined personal locker -->
+
+  <DMS_PersonallockerDestroyed.label>损毁的个人储物柜</DMS_PersonallockerDestroyed.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A rusted-out steel locker. Its door has been forced and whatever was inside is long gone. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+
+  <DMS_PersonallockerDestroyed.description>一个锈蚀殆尽的钢制储物柜，柜门早已被撬开，里面的东西也早已不知去向。将其破坏可以回收一些金属碎片。</DMS_PersonallockerDestroyed.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined locker bank -->
+
+  <DMS_Personallocker_LargeDestroyed.label>损毁的三连储物柜</DMS_Personallocker_LargeDestroyed.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A bank of three rusted-out steel lockers. The doors hang open or are missing entirely, and whatever was inside is long gone. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+
+  <DMS_Personallocker_LargeDestroyed.description>三个锈蚀殆尽的钢制储物柜，柜门或是敞开或是干脆不见了，里面的东西也早已不知去向。将其破坏可以回收一些金属碎片。</DMS_Personallocker_LargeDestroyed.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined water dispenser -->
+
+  <DMS_WaterdispenserDestroyed.label>损毁的饮水机</DMS_WaterdispenserDestroyed.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: The wreck of a water dispenser. The bottle is cracked and empty, and the taps have corroded solid. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+
+  <DMS_WaterdispenserDestroyed.description>一台饮水机的残骸，水桶已经开裂见底，水龙头也锈死了。将其破坏可以回收一些金属碎片。</DMS_WaterdispenserDestroyed.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined waiting bench -->
+
+  <DMS_BenchesDestroyed.label>损毁的等候长椅</DMS_BenchesDestroyed.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A row of seats on a rusted steel frame. The padding has rotted away and the frame is bent, so nobody will be sitting here again. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+
+  <DMS_BenchesDestroyed.description>锈蚀钢架上的一排座椅。将其破坏可以回收一些金属碎片。</DMS_BenchesDestroyed.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined air purifier -->
+
+  <DMS_AirpurifierDestroyed.label>损毁的空气净化机</DMS_AirpurifierDestroyed.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: The wreck of an air purification unit. Its filters are clogged solid and the housing has rusted through. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+
+  <DMS_AirpurifierDestroyed.description>一台空气净化装置的残骸，滤网已被彻底堵死，外壳也已锈穿。将其破坏可以回收一些金属碎片。</DMS_AirpurifierDestroyed.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined hydroponic planter -->
+
+  <DMS_Hydroponics_FlowerpotDestroyed.label>损毁的水培花盆</DMS_Hydroponics_FlowerpotDestroyed.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A dead hydroponic planter. The nutrient reservoir dried out long ago, leaving only a crust of withered roots. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+
+  <DMS_Hydroponics_FlowerpotDestroyed.description>一个早已枯死的水培花盆，营养液储槽早就干涸，只剩下一层枯根结成的硬壳。将其破坏可以回收一些金属碎片。</DMS_Hydroponics_FlowerpotDestroyed.description>
