+
+
+
+  <!-- ==================== Alert buildings ==================== -->
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: FPV nest -->
+
+  <DMS_Building_FPVNest.label>FPV无人机巢</DMS_Building_FPVNest.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: An automated drone nest used for facility defense. When alerted by the facility's other sensors, it automatically launches FPV drones to drive off or kill intruders, and it will also release drones to fight back when attacked. It is connected to the facility's underground logistics system below, so its expended drone stock is automatically replenished over time. -->
+
+  <DMS_Building_FPVNest.description>一种用于自动化设施防御的无人机巢，能够在接收到设施中其他传感器的警报后自动发射FPV无人机驱赶或杀伤入侵者。在受到攻击时也会释放无人机迎敌。其下方与设施的地下化物流系统相连，因此每隔一段时间就会自动补充损耗的无人机库存。</DMS_Building_FPVNest.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: FPV hangar -->
+
+  <DMS_Building_FPVHanger.label>FPV无人机库</DMS_Building_FPVHanger.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: An automated drone hangar used for facility defense. When alerted by the facility's other sensors, it automatically launches FPV drones to drive off or kill intruders, and it will also release drones to fight back when attacked. It is connected to the facility's underground logistics system below, so its expended drone stock is automatically replenished over time. -->
+
+  <DMS_Building_FPVHanger.description>一种用于自动化设施防御的无人机机库，能够在接收到设施中其他传感器的警报后自动发射FPV无人机驱赶或杀伤入侵者。在受到攻击时也会释放无人机迎敌。其下方与设施的地下化物流系统相连，因此每隔一段时间就会自动补充损耗的无人机库存。</DMS_Building_FPVHanger.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: camera -->
+
+  <DMS_Building_Camera.label>监视器</DMS_Building_Camera.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A surveillance camera that monitors a long, narrow corridor for intruders. Connected to the local alert counter. Cut power or hit it with an EMP to disable it safely before dismantling. -->
+
+  <DMS_Building_Camera.description>一种用于监视狭长通道、侦测入侵者的监控摄像机，连接着当地的警戒系统。先切断电源或以EMP将其瘫痪，即可在拆除前安全地使其失效。</DMS_Building_Camera.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: seismic sensor -->
