+  <DMS_Building_Sensor.label>震动传感器</DMS_Building_Sensor.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A passive sensor installed along pipes and secondary passageways. The larger the thing entering its range, the more likely it is to trip the alarm. -->
+
+  <DMS_Building_Sensor.description>一种安装在各类管道及次要通道的被动传感器，越大的东西进入其范围内就越容易引起警报。</DMS_Building_Sensor.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: large sentry tower -->
+
+  <DMS_Building_Scanner_Large.label>大型无人哨塔</DMS_Building_Scanner_Large.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A tall observation tower with automated sensors. Detects hostiles within a wide radius. Disable with EMP or power cut before attempting to dismantle. -->
+
+  <DMS_Building_Scanner_Large.description>一种长期自持运行的无人警戒平台，具有多种类型的传感器来监控大片范围内的可疑活动。一旦被惊动到就会广播警报信号来让周围的自动化防御设施启动迎敌。</DMS_Building_Scanner_Large.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: small sentry tower -->
+
+  <DMS_Building_Scanner_Small.label>小型无人哨塔</DMS_Building_Scanner_Small.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: An unmanned sentry platform built for long-term unattended operation, fitted with multiple types of sensors to monitor a wide area for suspicious activity. Once an intruder enters its range, it broadcasts an alert that activates the automated defenses to engage. -->
