+
+  <!-- EN: An active vent used for facility ventilation and NBC gas filtration. By keeping the facility under positive pressure, it prevents harmful gases from spreading through the facility's air circulation. -->
+
+  <DMS_Building_VentSmall.description>一种用于设施内通风与核生化气体过滤的主动式通风口，通过将设施保持为正压状态来避免有害气体通过气流在设施内扩散。</DMS_Building_VentSmall.description>
+
+  <DMS_Building_VentMedium.label>主动式通风口</DMS_Building_VentMedium.label>
+
+  <DMS_Building_VentMedium.description>一种用于设施内通风与核生化气体过滤的主动式通风口，通过将设施保持为正压状态来避免有害气体通过气流在设施内扩散。</DMS_Building_VentMedium.description>
+
