+  <DMS_Building_VentLarge.description>一种用于设施内通风与核生化气体过滤的主动式通风口，通过将设施保持为正压状态来避免有害气体通过气流在设施内扩散。</DMS_Building_VentLarge.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: rolling door / a locked rolling door. -->
+
+  <DMS_RollingDoor_Single.label>卷帘门</DMS_RollingDoor_Single.label>
