+
+
+  <!-- EN: substation cabinet -->
+
+  <DMS_SubstationCabinet.label>变电柜</DMS_SubstationCabinet.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A ruggedised metal cabinet that taps an underground power conduit and distributes electricity to surface equipment. The high-voltage internals make shut-down hazardous - only an operator with solid technical knowledge (Intellectual 8+) can safely cut power; anyone less experienced risks a serious electrical burn. An EMP strike will temporarily disable the cabinet without ongoing danger. -->
+
+  <DMS_SubstationCabinet.description>一座从地下输电管线取电并向地表设备配电的加固金属柜。其内部的高压组件使关停作业十分危险：只有具备扎实技术知识（智识8+）的操作者才能安全切断电源，经验不足者可能遭受严重的电灼伤。EMP打击可暂时瘫痪变电柜，且不会造成后续危险。</DMS_SubstationCabinet.description>
