+  <!-- EN: A compact substation panel mounted flush against a wall, routing underground power to surface equipment. Like its cabinet counterpart, shutting it down safely requires real technical skill - anyone less experienced risks a severe electrical burn from the exposed high-voltage contacts. Vulnerable to EMP. -->
+
+  <DMS_SubstationCabinet_Wall.description>一块紧贴墙面安装的小型变电盘，将地下电力输送至地表设备。与变电柜一样，安全关停需要真正的技术能力，经验不足者可能被外露的高压触点严重灼伤。易受EMP影响。</DMS_SubstationCabinet_Wall.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: emergency lighting -->
+
+  <DMS_EmergencyLamp.label>应急照明</DMS_EmergencyLamp.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: An emergency lighting system that automatically switches to its internal battery only when grid power is lost, glowing red for extended periods to maintain a minimum level of illumination even during an outage. -->
+
+  <DMS_EmergencyLamp.description>一种只在断电时使用内部电池自动亮起的应急照明系统，能够长时间发出红光确保即使断电也能够维持最低限度的照明。</DMS_EmergencyLamp.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- ==================== Heavy blast door ==================== -->
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: heavy blast door -->
+
+  <DMS_Building_DoorLarge.label>重型防爆门</DMS_Building_DoorLarge.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A reinforced heavy door built for military installations. It slides open along its track to let authorized personnel pass, and seals shut to block unauthorized intruders. -->
+
+  <DMS_Building_DoorLarge.description>一种为军事设施打造的重型加固大门，会沿着滑轨滑开让获授权的人员通行，并紧闭封锁未经授权的闯入者。</DMS_Building_DoorLarge.description>
+
+  <DMS_Building_DoorLarge_Mirrored.label>重型防爆门</DMS_Building_DoorLarge_Mirrored.label>
+
+  <DMS_Building_DoorLarge_Mirrored.description>一种为军事设施打造的重型加固大门，会沿着滑轨滑开让获授权的人员通行，并紧闭封锁未经授权的闯入者。</DMS_Building_DoorLarge_Mirrored.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined blast door -->
+
+  <DMS_Building_DoorLarge_Damaged.label>损毁的防爆门</DMS_Building_DoorLarge_Damaged.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: The wreckage of a heavy military blast door, jammed and burnt out. It no longer opens or seals which purely structural debris left standing amid the ruins. -->
+
+  <DMS_Building_DoorLarge_Damaged.description>一扇军用重型防爆门的残骸，已卡死并烧毁，无法再开启或封闭，仅是矗立于废墟之中的结构性残骸。</DMS_Building_DoorLarge_Damaged.description>
+
+  <DMS_Building_DoorLarge_Damaged_Mirrored.label>损毁的防爆门</DMS_Building_DoorLarge_Damaged_Mirrored.label>
+
+  <DMS_Building_DoorLarge_Damaged_Mirrored.description>一扇军用重型防爆门的残骸，已卡死并烧毁，无法再开启或封闭，仅是矗立于废墟之中的结构性残骸。</DMS_Building_DoorLarge_Damaged_Mirrored.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- ==================== RaidWave beacon ==================== -->
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: peacekeeping distress beacon -->
+
+  <DMS_RaidWaveBeacon_PeacekeepingOperators.label>维和求救信标</DMS_RaidWaveBeacon_PeacekeepingOperators.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A tampered emergency transponder repurposed to broadcast a false peacekeeping distress call. Once activated, it summons a Legacy remnant peacekeeping detachment - Protector shieldbearers screening a Ronin spearhead, with Falcon marksmen providing overwatch - to storm the signal's origin. The burst burns out the transmitter, so this building can only be used once. -->
+
+  <DMS_RaidWaveBeacon_PeacekeepingOperators.description>一台遭到改装的紧急应答机，被用来广播伪造的维和求救信号。启动后将召来一支先锋残余的维和特遣队：塔盾手在前掩护、浪人担任突击矛头、游隼提供火力支援，直扑信号来源。信号脉冲会烧毁发射器，因此该建筑只能使用一次。</DMS_RaidWaveBeacon_PeacekeepingOperators.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- ==================== Ruined facility buildings ==================== -->
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined artifuscle chamber -->
+
+  <DMS_TableArtifuscleDestroyed.label>损毁的生物培养装置</DMS_TableArtifuscleDestroyed.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: The wreck of a high-end artifuscle cultivation chamber. Its growth vats have shattered and their contents rotted away long ago. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+
+  <DMS_TableArtifuscleDestroyed.description>一台高端人工肌肉培养装置的残骸，其培养槽早已破裂，内容物也早已腐坏殆尽。将其破坏可以回收一些金属碎片。</DMS_TableArtifuscleDestroyed.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined machinery printer -->
+
+  <DMS_TableMachinePrinterDestroyed.label>损毁的机械冲压机</DMS_TableMachinePrinterDestroyed.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: The wreck of a composite metal printer. Its forging rams are seized solid and the print bed is buried under collapsed tooling. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+
+  <DMS_TableMachinePrinterDestroyed.description>一台复合金属打印机的残骸，其锻压冲头已彻底卡死，工作台也被坍塌的模具掩埋。将其破坏可以回收一些金属碎片。</DMS_TableMachinePrinterDestroyed.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined lab reactor -->
+
+  <DMS_LabReactorDestroyed.label>损毁的实验用反应釜</DMS_LabReactorDestroyed.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: The wreck of an experimental reaction chamber. Its vessel has ruptured and whatever it once processed has crusted over the burst plumbing. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+
+  <DMS_LabReactorDestroyed.description>一台实验用反应釜的残骸，其釜体已经破裂，曾经处理的物料早已结块凝固在爆开的管路上。将其破坏可以回收一些金属碎片。</DMS_LabReactorDestroyed.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined lab furnace -->
+
+  <DMS_LabFurnaceDestroyed.label>损毁的实验用箱型炉</DMS_LabFurnaceDestroyed.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: The wreck of an experimental sintering furnace, burnt out from the inside. Its heating elements are slagged and the chamber lining has collapsed. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+
+  <DMS_LabFurnaceDestroyed.description>一台从内部烧毁的实验用烧结炉残骸，其加热组件已熔成炉渣，炉膛内衬也已坍塌。将其破坏可以回收一些金属碎片。</DMS_LabFurnaceDestroyed.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined machine cabinet -->
+
+  <DMS_MachineCabinetDestroyed.label>损毁的机械柜</DMS_MachineCabinetDestroyed.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: The wreck of a calibration cabinet. Its precision instruments have been smashed or stripped, leaving only a gutted shell. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+
+  <DMS_MachineCabinetDestroyed.description>一座校准机械柜的残骸，其中的精密仪器早已被砸毁或拆走，只剩下被掏空的外壳。将其破坏可以回收一些金属碎片。</DMS_MachineCabinetDestroyed.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined hound station -->
+
+  <DMS_HoundBaseDestroyed.label>损毁的猎犬控制平台</DMS_HoundBaseDestroyed.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: The wreck of a hound unit charging station. Its docking cradle is empty and the charging contacts have corroded beyond repair. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+
+  <DMS_HoundBaseDestroyed.description>一座猎犬单位充电平台的残骸，其停驻架早已空置，充电触点也已锈蚀到无法修复。将其破坏可以回收一些金属碎片。</DMS_HoundBaseDestroyed.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined trashpan station -->
+
+  <DMS_TrashBinBaseDestroyed.label>损毁的垃圾盘控制平台</DMS_TrashBinBaseDestroyed.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: The wreck of a trashpan unit charging station. Its docking cradle is empty and the charging contacts have corroded beyond repair. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+
+  <DMS_TrashBinBaseDestroyed.description>一座垃圾盘单位充电平台的残骸，其停驻架早已空置，充电触点也已锈蚀到无法修复。将其破坏可以回收一些金属碎片。</DMS_TrashBinBaseDestroyed.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined logistic container -->
+
+  <DMS_LogisticContainerDestroyed.label>损毁的后勤货柜</DMS_LogisticContainerDestroyed.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A breached military cargo container. Whatever supplies it once held were looted or destroyed long ago, leaving only the torn shell. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+
+  <DMS_LogisticContainerDestroyed.description>一个被撬开的军用货柜，其中的补给物资早已被洗劫或摧毁，只剩下破损的外壳。将其破坏可以回收一些金属碎片。</DMS_LogisticContainerDestroyed.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- ==================== Loot crates ==================== -->
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: small material crate -->
+
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Material.label>小型物资箱</DMS_CrateSmall_Material.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A small standard issue equipment crate containing supplies. The lid carries no colour band, so there is no telling what is inside until it is opened. -->
+
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Material.description>一个标准制式的小型补给箱，内装补给物资。箱盖上没有颜色识别带，不打开就无从得知里面装了什么。</DMS_CrateSmall_Material.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: small compoment crate -->
+
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Parts.label>小型零件箱</DMS_CrateSmall_Parts.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A small standard issue supply crate. The blue band marks it as machine parts. Most hold ordinary components, though advanced ones turn up now and then. -->
+
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Parts.description>一个标准制式的小型补给箱。蓝色识别带代表内容物是机械零件。多数只有普通零件，偶尔会有高级零件。</DMS_CrateSmall_Parts.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: small arms crate -->
+
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_SmallArms.label>小型轻武器箱</DMS_CrateSmall_SmallArms.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A small standard issue supply crate. The red band marks it as weapons. Inside is a single small arm, still packed in factory grease. -->
+
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_SmallArms.description>一个标准制式的小型补给箱。红色识别带代表内容物是武器。里面装着一把小型枪械，仍涂着出厂封存油脂。</DMS_CrateSmall_SmallArms.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: small prosthetics crate -->
+
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Prosthetic.label>小型义体箱</DMS_CrateSmall_Prosthetic.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A small standard issue supply crate. The green band marks it as medical supplies. Most hold stamponents, though a bionic part turns up now and then. -->
+
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Prosthetic.description>一个标准制式的小型补给箱。绿色识别带代表内容物是医疗物资。多数只有冲压零件，偶尔会有仿生体。</DMS_CrateSmall_Prosthetic.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: small ration crate -->
+
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Ration.label>小型口粮箱</DMS_CrateSmall_Ration.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A small standard issue supply crate. The yellow band marks it as food. Inside are survival meals or combat rations. -->
+
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Ration.description>一个标准制式的小型补给箱。黄色识别带代表内容物是食品。里面装着生存食品包或C口粮。</DMS_CrateSmall_Ration.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- ==================== Occultech data caches ==================== -->
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: Decrypt {0_label} -->
+
+  <DMS_DataCache_Restricted.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>破译{0_label}</DMS_DataCache_Restricted.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
+
+  <DMS_DataCache_Sealed.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>破译{0_label}</DMS_DataCache_Sealed.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
+
+  <DMS_DataCache_Occulted.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>破译{0_label}</DMS_DataCache_Occulted.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: restricted technical data cache -->
+
+  <DMS_DataCache_Restricted.label>管制技术数据匣</DMS_DataCache_Restricted.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: An encrypted record module holding a technical file that was never cleared for local circulation, kept by colonial army units as a reference for technical signatures. ... -->
+
+  <DMS_DataCache_Restricted.description>一个加密的记录模块，里面是一份从未获准在地方流通的技术档案碎片，被殖民陆军各单位用于封存技术特征的参考数据来在第一时间对可能的数据泄漏做出应对。殖民者可以花上几个小时将其破译，虽然无法直接获取完整技术但能够探明一项管制级的封存技术研究并取得少许进度。</DMS_DataCache_Restricted.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: sealed data cache -->
+
+  <DMS_DataCache_Sealed.label>封存数据匣</DMS_DataCache_Sealed.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: A record module with its seal intact. ... -->
+
+  <DMS_DataCache_Sealed.description>一个封条完好的记录模块。这个等级的档案通常不会离开舰队看管的数据库中。殖民者可以将其破译，探明一项封存级的封存技术研究并取得一些进度。</DMS_DataCache_Sealed.description>
+
+
+
+  <!-- EN: occulted data cache -->
+
+  <DMS_DataCache_Occulted.label>禁忌数据匣</DMS_DataCache_Occulted.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: An unmarked composite record module with no ports and no seams. ... -->
+
+  <DMS_DataCache_Occulted.description>一块没有接口也没有接缝的无标记复合材料记录模块。殖民者可以将其破译，探明一项禁忌级的封存技术研究并取得一些进度。</DMS_DataCache_Occulted.description>
+
+
+
+</LanguageData>
+

--- DMS1/NewContent/Languages/ChineseSimplified (简体中文)/DefInjected/ThingDef/DMS_Subsonic.xml

+++ DMS2/NewContent/Languages/ChineseSimplified (简体中文)/DefInjected/ThingDef/DMS_Subsonic.xml

@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@

+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
+<LanguageData>
+
+  <!-- EN: infrasonic module -->
+  <DMS_SubsonicModule.label>次声波改装模块</DMS_SubsonicModule.label>
+  <DMS_SubsonicModule.description>一组经过调谐的次声波发生器阵列，封装成可直接锁上机兵外壳并从其电池取电的模块。接到命令时，它会以机兵为中心释放一次次声波。范围内的敌对生物会被恶心与剧痛折磨，其中不少会当场崩溃逃窜。机械体不受影响。\n\n发生器会持续耗电，使机兵的能量消耗略微增加。</DMS_SubsonicModule.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: infrasonic grenades -->
+  <DMS_Weapon_GrenadeSubsonic.label>次声波手雷</DMS_Weapon_GrenadeSubsonic.label>
+  <DMS_Weapon_GrenadeSubsonic.description>以一次调谐次声波取代破片的手雷。次声波能同样穿透墙壁与掩体，因此会直接作用于范围内的每一个生物，不分敌我，使其恶心、剧痛，并让不少人陷入恐慌。对建筑与机械体无效。</DMS_Weapon_GrenadeSubsonic.description>
+  <DMS_Weapon_GrenadeSubsonic.verbs.0.label>投掷次声波手雷</DMS_Weapon_GrenadeSubsonic.verbs.0.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: infrasonic grenade -->
+  <DMS_Proj_GrenadeSubsonic.label>次声波手雷</DMS_Proj_GrenadeSubsonic.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: infrasonic emitter -->
+  <DMS_Building_SubsonicEmitter.label>次声波塔</DMS_Building_SubsonicEmitter.label>
+  <DMS_Building_SubsonicEmitter.description>架设在塔上的调谐次声波发生器阵列。通电时会间歇性地释放一次次声波，穿透墙壁作用于范围内所有敌对生物，使其恶心、剧痛，并让不少人陷入恐慌。范围内没有敌人时不会发射。机械体不受影响。</DMS_Building_SubsonicEmitter.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: blast scanner -->
+  <DMS_Building_BlastScanner.label>爆破勘探装置</DMS_Building_BlastScanner.label>
+  <DMS_Building_BlastScanner.description>一种用于地质勘探用的精密机器，具有一个由迫击炮弹驱动的装置来发射震波并接收回波探明地下的矿藏位置。一次装药可以同时探明数处深层矿脉。\n\n但使用这种装置勘探几乎必然会惊动地下休眠的虫群，而它们往往会从惊扰它们的东西附近钻出地面。\n\n装入一发高爆炮弹后点燃引信即可。每次引爆后装置需要时间重新校准。</DMS_Building_BlastScanner.description>
+  <DMS_Building_BlastScanner.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>炸药</DMS_Building_BlastScanner.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
+  <DMS_Building_BlastScanner.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>炸药</DMS_Building_BlastScanner.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
+  <DMS_Building_BlastScanner.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>未装填炸药</DMS_Building_BlastScanner.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
+
+</LanguageData>

