+
+
+
+  <DMS_MechCapsule_VaultFrame.label>封存中的战斗框架</DMS_MechCapsule_VaultFrame.label>
+
+  <DMS_MechCapsule_VaultFrame.description>一具处于休眠状态的战斗框架。它的指令认证随着拥有它的单位一起失效了。机械师可以尝试骇入并控制它。</DMS_MechCapsule_VaultFrame.description>
+
+
+
+</LanguageData>
+

--- DMS1/NewContent/Languages/ChineseSimplified (简体中文)/DefInjected/ThingDef/DMS_Vault_Treasury.xml

+++ DMS2/NewContent/Languages/ChineseSimplified (简体中文)/DefInjected/ThingDef/DMS_Vault_Treasury.xml

@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@

+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
+
+<LanguageData>
+
+
+
+  <DMS_VaultConsole.label>安全控制台</DMS_VaultConsole.label>
+
+  <DMS_VaultConsole.description>储存库的门禁控制终端。密封的库房门只听这台控制台的，而它的授权早就跟着拥有这里的部队一起失效了。骇入它以放行库房门。</DMS_VaultConsole.description>
+
+  <DMS_VaultConsole.comps.0.notHackedInspectString>骇入以放行密封的库房门。</DMS_VaultConsole.comps.0.notHackedInspectString>
+
