+
+  <DMS_FacilityServerCore.label>設施伺服核心</DMS_FacilityServerCore.label>
+  <DMS_FacilityServerCore.description>一台體積不小的電晶體電腦，這種古老但可靠性極高的設備常見於殖民艦隊的各種設施內作為無紙化辦公與文書資料儲存的主機。其內部使用一種特殊的放射性電池來為自身提供運行能源來確保在無人職守的狀態下仍能夠長期運行。\n\n這些伺服核心的底層資料內通常儲存有重要的科技藍圖與通行密鑰紀錄備份，駭入必然會牽動整個設施的警報系統響應，因此在開始駭入之前最好做充足的防禦準備。</DMS_FacilityServerCore.description>
+
+  <DMS_FacilityDataRack.label>設施數據輔機</DMS_FacilityDataRack.label>
+  <DMS_FacilityDataRack.description>與設施主機並聯運作的磁帶與磁芯記憶體機櫃，負責存放主機調閱頻率較低的歸檔資料。它本身不具備獨立的運算與存取介面，所有資料都必須經由主機讀出。</DMS_FacilityDataRack.description>
+
+  <DMS_SiteServerCore.label>站點伺服主機</DMS_SiteServerCore.label>
+  <DMS_SiteServerCore.description>一台體積較小的電晶體電腦，這種古老但可靠性極高的設備常見於殖民艦隊的各種設施內作為無紙化辦公與文書資料儲存的主機。其內部使用一種特殊的放射性電池來為自身提供運行能源來確保在無人職守的狀態下仍能夠長期運行。\n\n這種小型站點上使用的主機通常來說不會儲存太機密的數據，但仍可以從中提取到有價值的情報。一旦駭入就會觸發主機的安全警報響應，因此在開始駭入之前最好做充足的防禦準備。</DMS_SiteServerCore.description>
+
+  <DMS_SageCore.label>賢者</DMS_SageCore.label>
+  <DMS_SageCore.description>一種分布式計算的戰略指揮計算機，能夠根據使用需求無上限的擴充輔機並提升計算能力，被殖民艦隊用於殖民星球上的戰略防空以及連接數個大陸上的無數雷達追蹤及導航網路。將其摧毀必然會對殖民艦隊在星球上的追緝行動造成嚴重的影響，但在一兩年內整個SAGE網路內的另一台計算機就會升格為主機繼續接手任務規劃。\n\n它的底層儲存區保留著部分戰略資料庫的副本，駭入時整個設施的警報系統都會被牽動。</DMS_SageCore.description>
+
+  <DMS_Building_GasVent.label>毒氣釋放口</DMS_Building_GasVent.label>
+  <DMS_Building_GasVent.description>安裝在地板上、連接著設施警報網路的格柵。警報響起時，它會先發出短暫的嘶嘶聲，接著朝周圍噴出大量毒氣。設施裡的機械守軍不需要呼吸，其他人最好戴著防毒面具。它的存量足夠釋放數次，並會從下方的儲氣槽慢慢補充。切斷電源或以EMP癱瘓就能讓它停下，即使正在噴發中也一樣。</DMS_Building_GasVent.description>
+  
+  <DMS_Building_SubsonicEmitter_Security.label>警戒次聲波塔</DMS_Building_SubsonicEmitter_Security.label>
+  <DMS_Building_SubsonicEmitter_Security.description>架設在塔上、連接著設施警報網路的次聲波發生器陣列。平時保持靜默，警報響起後約一小時內會反覆釋放次聲波，穿透牆壁作用於範圍內所有入侵者，使其噁心、劇痛，並讓不少人陷入恐慌。設施的機兵守軍不受影響。切斷電源或以 EMP 攻擊即可使其停火。</DMS_Building_SubsonicEmitter_Security.description>
+
+  <DMS_Building_LockdownController.label>設施封鎖中控</DMS_Building_LockdownController.label>
+  <DMS_Building_LockdownController.description>一個用於協調地下設施封鎖出入口閘門的應急控制裝置，一旦完成封鎖就會使出入口無法使用。這類安全裝置在設計上會在自身被摧毀後完全封鎖設施，此時就必需要有人從外面幫助才能開門。\n\n設施的警戒值達到上限時它就會啟動，並在一分鐘後封死出入口。駭入它就能解除封鎖，也可以事先駭入讓它失效。它使用設施的放射性電池運作，切斷電源沒有作用；EMP只能暫停倒數。</DMS_Building_LockdownController.description>
+
+  <DMS_ArchiveElevator.label>檔案庫貨運電梯</DMS_ArchiveElevator.label>
+  <DMS_ArchiveElevator.description>一座地下設施檔案庫的地表電梯。殖民艦隊把文書與資料主機設在地下，以隔絕溫差、震動與電磁干擾，地表只留下這座電梯。車廂仍然有電，但控制系統已經上鎖，必須駭入才能把車廂叫上來。</DMS_ArchiveElevator.description>
+
+</LanguageData>

--- DMS1/NewContent/Languages/ChineseTraditional (繁體中文)/DefInjected/ThingDef/DMS_Furniture.xml

+++ DMS2/NewContent/Languages/ChineseTraditional (繁體中文)/DefInjected/ThingDef/DMS_Furniture.xml

@@ -0,0 +1,68 @@

+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
+<LanguageData>
+
+  <!-- ==================== Facility furniture ==================== -->
+
+  <!-- EN: personal locker -->
+  <DMS_Personallocker.label>個人置物櫃</DMS_Personallocker.label>
+  <!-- EN: A tall steel locker for storing personal effects. Standard issue in facility changing rooms and dormitories. -->
+  <DMS_Personallocker.description>一種用於存放個人物品的鋼製置物櫃，是設施更衣室與宿舍的標準配置。</DMS_Personallocker.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: locker bank -->
+  <DMS_Personallocker_Large.label>三連置物櫃</DMS_Personallocker_Large.label>
+  <!-- EN: A bank of three steel lockers bolted together. Standard issue in facility changing rooms and dormitories. -->
+  <DMS_Personallocker_Large.description>三個拼接固定在一起的鋼製置物櫃，是設施更衣室與宿舍的標準配置。</DMS_Personallocker_Large.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: water dispenser -->
+  <DMS_Waterdispenser.label>飲水機</DMS_Waterdispenser.label>
+  <!-- EN: A bottled water dispenser with hot and cold taps. A small comfort in an otherwise sterile facility. -->
+  <DMS_Waterdispenser.description>一台配有冷熱水龍頭的桶裝飲水機，為冰冷的設施帶來一點小小的舒適。</DMS_Waterdispenser.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: waiting bench -->
+  <DMS_Benches.label>等候長椅</DMS_Benches.label>
+  <!-- EN: A row of three padded seats on a steel frame, of the kind found in facility corridors and waiting areas. Somewhat comfortable to sit on. -->
+  <DMS_Benches.description>鋼架上並排安裝著三張軟墊座椅，常見於設施的走廊與等候區。坐起來還算舒適。</DMS_Benches.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: air purifier -->
+  <DMS_Airpurifier.label>空氣清淨機</DMS_Airpurifier.label>
+  <!-- EN: A free-standing air purification unit. Its filters strip dust and contaminants out of the air, keeping the facility's rooms clean. -->
+  <DMS_Airpurifier.description>一台落地式空氣清淨裝置，其濾網能過濾空氣中的灰塵與污染物，保持設施房間的清潔。</DMS_Airpurifier.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: hydroponic planter -->
+  <DMS_Hydroponics_Flowerpot.label>水耕花盆</DMS_Hydroponics_Flowerpot.label>
+  <!-- EN: A self-contained hydroponic planter with its own nutrient reservoir. Grow decorative flowers here to improve the mood of people nearby. -->
+  <DMS_Hydroponics_Flowerpot.description>一個自帶營養液儲槽的獨立式水耕花盆。在這裡種植觀賞花卉可以改善周圍人員的心情。</DMS_Hydroponics_Flowerpot.description>
+
+  <!-- ==================== Facility furniture (ruined) ==================== -->
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined personal locker -->
+  <DMS_PersonallockerDestroyed.label>損毀的個人置物櫃</DMS_PersonallockerDestroyed.label>
+  <!-- EN: A rusted-out steel locker. Its door has been forced and whatever was inside is long gone. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+  <DMS_PersonallockerDestroyed.description>一個鏽蝕殆盡的鋼製置物櫃，櫃門早已被撬開，裡面的東西也早已不知去向。將其破壞可以回收一些金屬碎片。</DMS_PersonallockerDestroyed.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined locker bank -->
+  <DMS_Personallocker_LargeDestroyed.label>損毀的三連置物櫃</DMS_Personallocker_LargeDestroyed.label>
+  <!-- EN: A bank of three rusted-out steel lockers. The doors hang open or are missing entirely, and whatever was inside is long gone. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+  <DMS_Personallocker_LargeDestroyed.description>三個鏽蝕殆盡的鋼製置物櫃，櫃門或是敞開或是乾脆不見了，裡面的東西也早已不知去向。將其破壞可以回收一些金屬碎片。</DMS_Personallocker_LargeDestroyed.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined water dispenser -->
+  <DMS_WaterdispenserDestroyed.label>損毀的飲水機</DMS_WaterdispenserDestroyed.label>
+  <!-- EN: The wreck of a water dispenser. The bottle is cracked and empty, and the taps have corroded solid. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+  <DMS_WaterdispenserDestroyed.description>一台飲水機的殘骸，水桶已經開裂見底，水龍頭也鏽死了。將其破壞可以回收一些金屬碎片。</DMS_WaterdispenserDestroyed.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined waiting bench -->
+  <DMS_BenchesDestroyed.label>損毀的等候長椅</DMS_BenchesDestroyed.label>
+  <!-- EN: A row of seats on a rusted steel frame. The padding has rotted away and the frame is bent, so nobody will be sitting here again. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+  <DMS_BenchesDestroyed.description>鏽蝕鋼架上的一排座椅。將其破壞可以回收一些金屬碎片。</DMS_BenchesDestroyed.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined air purifier -->
+  <DMS_AirpurifierDestroyed.label>損毀的空氣清淨機</DMS_AirpurifierDestroyed.label>
+  <!-- EN: The wreck of an air purification unit. Its filters are clogged solid and the housing has rusted through. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+  <DMS_AirpurifierDestroyed.description>一台空氣清淨裝置的殘骸，濾網已被徹底堵死，外殼也已鏽穿。將其破壞可以回收一些金屬碎片。</DMS_AirpurifierDestroyed.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined hydroponic planter -->
+  <DMS_Hydroponics_FlowerpotDestroyed.label>損毀的水耕花盆</DMS_Hydroponics_FlowerpotDestroyed.label>
+  <!-- EN: A dead hydroponic planter. The nutrient reservoir dried out long ago, leaving only a crust of withered roots. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+  <DMS_Hydroponics_FlowerpotDestroyed.description>一個早已枯死的水耕花盆，營養液儲槽早就乾涸，只剩下一層枯根結成的硬殼。將其破壞可以回收一些金屬碎片。</DMS_Hydroponics_FlowerpotDestroyed.description>
+
+</LanguageData>

