--- DMS1/NewContent/Languages/ChineseTraditional (繁體中文)/DefInjected/ThingDef/DMS_NewContent.xml

+++ DMS2/NewContent/Languages/ChineseTraditional (繁體中文)/DefInjected/ThingDef/DMS_NewContent.xml

@@ -0,0 +1,276 @@

+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
+<LanguageData>
+
+  <!-- ==================== Alert buildings ==================== -->
+
+  <!-- EN: FPV nest -->
+  <DMS_Building_FPVNest.label>FPV無人機巢</DMS_Building_FPVNest.label>
+  <!-- EN: An automated drone nest used for facility defense. When alerted by the facility's other sensors, it automatically launches FPV drones to drive off or kill intruders, and it will also release drones to fight back when attacked. It is connected to the facility's underground logistics system below, so its expended drone stock is automatically replenished over time. -->
+  <DMS_Building_FPVNest.description>一種用於自動化設施防禦的無人機巢，能夠在接收到設施中其他傳感器的警報後自動發射FPV無人機驅趕或殺傷入侵者。在受到攻擊時也會釋放無人機迎敵。其下方與設施的地下化物流系統相連，因此每隔一段時間就會自動補充損耗的無人機庫存。</DMS_Building_FPVNest.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: FPV hangar -->
+  <DMS_Building_FPVHanger.label>FPV無人機庫</DMS_Building_FPVHanger.label>
+  <!-- EN: An automated drone hangar used for facility defense. When alerted by the facility's other sensors, it automatically launches FPV drones to drive off or kill intruders, and it will also release drones to fight back when attacked. It is connected to the facility's underground logistics system below, so its expended drone stock is automatically replenished over time. -->
+  <DMS_Building_FPVHanger.description>一種用於自動化設施防禦的無人機機庫，能夠在接收到設施中其他傳感器的警報後自動發射FPV無人機驅趕或殺傷入侵者。在受到攻擊時也會釋放無人機迎敵。其下方與設施的地下化物流系統相連，因此每隔一段時間就會自動補充損耗的無人機庫存。</DMS_Building_FPVHanger.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: camera -->
+  <DMS_Building_Camera.label>監視器</DMS_Building_Camera.label>
+  <!-- EN: A surveillance camera that monitors a long, narrow corridor for intruders. Connected to the local alert counter. Cut power or hit it with an EMP to disable it safely before dismantling. -->
+  <DMS_Building_Camera.description>一種用於監視狹長通道、偵測入侵者的監控攝影機，連接著當地的警戒系統。先切斷電源或以EMP將其癱瘓，即可在拆除前安全地使其失效。</DMS_Building_Camera.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: seismic sensor -->
+  <DMS_Building_Sensor.label>震動傳感器</DMS_Building_Sensor.label>
+  <!-- EN: A passive sensor installed along pipes and secondary passageways. The larger the thing entering its range, the more likely it is to trip the alarm. -->
+  <DMS_Building_Sensor.description>一種安裝在各類管道及次要通道的被動傳感器，越大的東西進入其範圍內就越容易引起警報。</DMS_Building_Sensor.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: large sentry tower -->
+  <DMS_Building_Scanner_Large.label>大型無人哨塔</DMS_Building_Scanner_Large.label>
+  <!-- EN: A tall observation tower with automated sensors. Detects hostiles within a wide radius. Disable with EMP or power cut before attempting to dismantle. -->
+  <DMS_Building_Scanner_Large.description>一種長期自持運行的無人警戒平台，具有多種類型的傳感器來監控大片範圍內的可疑活動。一旦被驚動到就會廣播警報訊號來讓周圍的自動化防禦設施啟動迎敵。</DMS_Building_Scanner_Large.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: small sentry tower -->
