+  <DMS_HoundBaseDestroyed.label>損毀的獵犬控制平台</DMS_HoundBaseDestroyed.label>
+  <!-- EN: The wreck of a hound unit charging station. Its docking cradle is empty and the charging contacts have corroded beyond repair. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+  <DMS_HoundBaseDestroyed.description>一座獵犬單位充電平台的殘骸，其停駐架早已空置，充電觸點也已鏽蝕到無法修復。將其破壞可以回收一些金屬碎片。</DMS_HoundBaseDestroyed.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined trashpan station -->
+  <DMS_TrashBinBaseDestroyed.label>損毀的垃圾盤控制平台</DMS_TrashBinBaseDestroyed.label>
+  <!-- EN: The wreck of a trashpan unit charging station. Its docking cradle is empty and the charging contacts have corroded beyond repair. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+  <DMS_TrashBinBaseDestroyed.description>一座垃圾盤單位充電平台的殘骸，其停駐架早已空置，充電觸點也已鏽蝕到無法修復。將其破壞可以回收一些金屬碎片。</DMS_TrashBinBaseDestroyed.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: ruined logistic container -->
+  <DMS_LogisticContainerDestroyed.label>損毀的後勤貨櫃</DMS_LogisticContainerDestroyed.label>
+  <!-- EN: A breached military cargo container. Whatever supplies it once held were looted or destroyed long ago, leaving only the torn shell. Breaking it down yields some metal scrap. -->
+  <DMS_LogisticContainerDestroyed.description>一個被撬開的軍用貨櫃，其中的補給物資早已被洗劫或摧毀，只剩下破損的外殼。將其破壞可以回收一些金屬碎片。</DMS_LogisticContainerDestroyed.description>
+
+  <!-- ==================== Loot crates ==================== -->
+
+  <!-- EN: small material crate -->
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Material.label>小型物資箱</DMS_CrateSmall_Material.label>
+  <!-- EN: A small standard issue equipment crate containing supplies. The lid carries no colour band, so there is no telling what is inside until it is opened. -->
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Material.description>一個標準制式的小型補給箱，內裝補給物資。箱蓋上沒有顏色識別帶，不打開就無從得知裡面裝了什麼。</DMS_CrateSmall_Material.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: small compoment crate -->
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Parts.label>小型零件箱</DMS_CrateSmall_Parts.label>
+  <!-- EN: A small standard issue supply crate. The blue band marks it as machine parts. Most hold ordinary components, though advanced ones turn up now and then. -->
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Parts.description>一個標準制式的小型補給箱。藍色識別帶代表內容物是機械零件。多數只有普通零件，偶爾會有高級零件。</DMS_CrateSmall_Parts.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: small arms crate -->
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_SmallArms.label>小型輕武器箱</DMS_CrateSmall_SmallArms.label>
+  <!-- EN: A small standard issue supply crate. The red band marks it as weapons. Inside is a single small arm, still packed in factory grease. -->
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_SmallArms.description>一個標準制式的小型補給箱。紅色識別帶代表內容物是武器。裡面裝著一把小型槍械，仍塗著出廠封存油脂。</DMS_CrateSmall_SmallArms.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: small prosthetics crate -->
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Prosthetic.label>小型義體箱</DMS_CrateSmall_Prosthetic.label>
+  <!-- EN: A small standard issue supply crate. The green band marks it as medical supplies. Most hold stamponents, though a bionic part turns up now and then. -->
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Prosthetic.description>一個標準制式的小型補給箱。綠色識別帶代表內容物是醫療物資。多數只有沖壓零件，偶爾會有仿生體。</DMS_CrateSmall_Prosthetic.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: small ration crate -->
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Ration.label>小型口糧箱</DMS_CrateSmall_Ration.label>
+  <!-- EN: A small standard issue supply crate. The yellow band marks it as food. Inside are survival meals or combat rations. -->
+  <DMS_CrateSmall_Ration.description>一個標準制式的小型補給箱。黃色識別帶代表內容物是食品。裡面裝著生存食品包或C口糧。</DMS_CrateSmall_Ration.description>
+
+  <!-- ==================== Occultech data caches ==================== -->
+
+  <!-- EN: Decrypt {0_label} -->
+  <DMS_DataCache_Restricted.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>破譯{0_label}</DMS_DataCache_Restricted.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
+  <DMS_DataCache_Sealed.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>破譯{0_label}</DMS_DataCache_Sealed.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
+  <DMS_DataCache_Occulted.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>破譯{0_label}</DMS_DataCache_Occulted.comps.CompUsable.useLabel>
+
+  <!-- EN: restricted technical data cache -->
+  <DMS_DataCache_Restricted.label>管制技術資料匣</DMS_DataCache_Restricted.label>
+  <!-- EN: An encrypted record module holding a technical file that was never cleared for local circulation, kept by colonial army units as a reference for technical signatures. ... -->
+  <DMS_DataCache_Restricted.description>一個加密的記錄模組，裡面是一份從未獲准在地方流通的技術檔案碎片，被殖民陸軍各單位用於封存技術特徵的參考資料來在第一時間對可能的數據洩漏做出應對。殖民者可以花上幾個小時將其破譯，雖然無法直接獲取完整技術但能夠探明一項管制級的封存技術研究並取得少許進度。</DMS_DataCache_Restricted.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: sealed data cache -->
+  <DMS_DataCache_Sealed.label>封存資料匣</DMS_DataCache_Sealed.label>
+  <!-- EN: A record module with its seal intact. ... -->
+  <DMS_DataCache_Sealed.description>一個封條完好的記錄模組。這個等級的檔案通常不會離開艦隊看管的資料庫中。殖民者可以將其破譯，探明一項封存級的封存技術研究並取得一些進度。</DMS_DataCache_Sealed.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: occulted data cache -->
+  <DMS_DataCache_Occulted.label>禁忌資料匣</DMS_DataCache_Occulted.label>
+  <!-- EN: An unmarked composite record module with no ports and no seams. ... -->
+  <DMS_DataCache_Occulted.description>一塊沒有接口也沒有接縫的無標記複合材料記錄模組。殖民者可以將其破譯，探明一項禁忌級的封存技術研究並取得一些進度。</DMS_DataCache_Occulted.description>
+
+</LanguageData>

--- DMS1/NewContent/Languages/ChineseTraditional (繁體中文)/DefInjected/ThingDef/DMS_Subsonic.xml

+++ DMS2/NewContent/Languages/ChineseTraditional (繁體中文)/DefInjected/ThingDef/DMS_Subsonic.xml

@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@

+<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
+<LanguageData>
+
+  <!-- EN: infrasonic module -->
+  <DMS_SubsonicModule.label>次聲波改裝模塊</DMS_SubsonicModule.label>
+  <DMS_SubsonicModule.description>一組經過調諧的次聲波發生器陣列，封裝成可直接鎖上機兵外殼並從其電池取電的模塊。接到命令時，它會以機兵為中心釋放一次次聲波。範圍內的敵對生物會被噁心與劇痛折磨，其中不少會當場崩潰逃竄。機械體不受影響。\n\n發生器會持續耗電，使機兵的能量消耗略微增加。</DMS_SubsonicModule.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: infrasonic grenades -->
+  <DMS_Weapon_GrenadeSubsonic.label>次聲波手雷</DMS_Weapon_GrenadeSubsonic.label>
+  <DMS_Weapon_GrenadeSubsonic.description>以一次調諧次聲波取代破片的手雷。次聲波能同樣穿透牆壁與掩體，因此會直接作用於範圍內的每一個生物，不分敵我，使其噁心、劇痛，並讓不少人陷入恐慌。對建築與機械體無效。</DMS_Weapon_GrenadeSubsonic.description>
+  <DMS_Weapon_GrenadeSubsonic.verbs.0.label>投擲次聲波手雷</DMS_Weapon_GrenadeSubsonic.verbs.0.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: infrasonic grenade -->
+  <DMS_Proj_GrenadeSubsonic.label>次聲波手雷</DMS_Proj_GrenadeSubsonic.label>
+
+  <!-- EN: infrasonic emitter -->
+  <DMS_Building_SubsonicEmitter.label>次聲波塔</DMS_Building_SubsonicEmitter.label>
+  <DMS_Building_SubsonicEmitter.description>架設在塔上的調諧次聲波發生器陣列。通電時會間歇性地釋放一次次聲波，穿透牆壁作用於範圍內所有敵對生物，使其噁心、劇痛，並讓不少人陷入恐慌。範圍內沒有敵人時不會發射。機械體不受影響。</DMS_Building_SubsonicEmitter.description>
+
+  <!-- EN: blast scanner -->
+  <DMS_Building_BlastScanner.label>爆破探勘裝置</DMS_Building_BlastScanner.label>
+  <DMS_Building_BlastScanner.description>一種用於地質探勘用的精密機器，具有一個由迫擊砲彈驅動的裝置來發射震波並接收回波探明地下的礦藏位置。一次裝藥可以同時探明數處深層礦脈。\n\n但使用這種裝置探勘幾乎必然會驚動地下休眠的蟲群，而牠們往往會從驚擾牠們的東西附近鑽出地面。\n\n裝入一發高爆砲彈後點燃引信即可。每次引爆後裝置需要時間重新校準。</DMS_Building_BlastScanner.description>
+  <DMS_Building_BlastScanner.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>炸藥</DMS_Building_BlastScanner.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelLabel>
+  <DMS_Building_BlastScanner.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>炸藥</DMS_Building_BlastScanner.comps.CompRefuelable.fuelGizmoLabel>
+  <DMS_Building_BlastScanner.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>未裝填炸藥</DMS_Building_BlastScanner.comps.CompRefuelable.outOfFuelMessage>
+
+</LanguageData>

