+  <DMS_Building_Scanner_LargeDestoryed.description>A large unmanned sentry platform that ceased functioning long ago. Its sensor array is completely destroyed, no longer able to detect intruders or broadcast alerts. The remaining tower structure makes decent cover. Tearing it down completely takes a while, but yields a small amount of metal scrap.</DMS_Building_Scanner_LargeDestoryed.description>
