+  <DMS_SubstationCabinet.description>A ruggedised metal cabinet that taps an underground power conduit and distributes electricity to surface equipment. The high-voltage internals make shut-down hazardous - only an operator with solid technical knowledge (Intellectual 8+) can safely cut power; anyone less experienced risks a serious electrical burn. An EMP strike will temporarily disable the cabinet without ongoing danger.</DMS_SubstationCabinet.description>
