+  <DMS_SubstationCabinet_Wall.description>A compact substation panel mounted flush against a wall, routing underground power to surface equipment. Like its cabinet counterpart, shutting it down safely requires real technical skill - anyone less experienced risks a severe electrical burn from the exposed high-voltage contacts. Vulnerable to EMP.</DMS_SubstationCabinet_Wall.description>
