+  <!-- EN: A tampered emergency transponder repurposed to broadcast a false peacekeeping distress call. Once activated, it summons a Legacy remnant peacekeeping detachment - Protector shieldbearers screening a Ronin spearhead, with Falcon marksmen providing overwatch - to storm the signal's origin. The burst burns out the transmitter, so this building can only be used once. -->
+  <DMS_RaidWaveBeacon_PeacekeepingOperators.description>A tampered emergency transponder repurposed to broadcast a false peacekeeping distress call. Once activated, it summons a Legacy remnant peacekeeping detachment - Protector shieldbearers screening a Ronin spearhead, with Falcon marksmen providing overwatch - to storm the signal's origin. The burst burns out the transmitter, so this building can only be used once.</DMS_RaidWaveBeacon_PeacekeepingOperators.description>
