+  <DMS_HuntBreaker_SuspendedText>{NODE_definite} has been destroyed.\n\nWithout it, {FLEET}'s radar tracking and navigation network on this planet has a gaping hole in it. They have lost track of us, and the hunt has been called off.\n\nThis will not last. Another computer on the SAGE network will take over the node's work sooner or later; the hunt should start again in about {DURATION}.\n\nNote: our permanent hostility with the fleet has not been lifted.</DMS_HuntBreaker_SuspendedText>
