+  <DMS_OperationBase_ClearedText>All hostiles at the remnant forward base have been neutralized.\n\nThe supply dump is yours. Hack both security consoles to open the blast doors, then hack the freight elevator itself to reach the store below, but the remnants will keep probing the perimeter.</DMS_OperationBase_ClearedText>
